Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.64,0:01:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gentlemen，we are in danger。There is a storm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.92,0:01:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,My men are terrified。We must leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.84,0:01:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,That tomb is here somewhere。I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please，Robert，it's been two months！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.24,0:01:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Archie，I'm not stopping！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.52,0:01:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.84,0:01:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's going on with this wind，Pop？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.84,0:01:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,C.J，go wait in the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.24,0:01:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't want to just wait in the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.52,0:01:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,I said go！Windows up！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.40,0:01:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Robert！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.48,0:01:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Fredericks！What？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.60,0:02:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.48,0:02:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,C.J？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.92,0:02:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.12,0:02:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I'm fine！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.28,0:02:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm coming down！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.24,0:02:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I looked for the tomb of Ahkmenrah for 20 years，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.96,0:02:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,and what do you do？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.12,0:02:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,You fall right into it！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:02:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Amir，start loading the trucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.08,0:03:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Fredericks…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.44,0:03:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,there is no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.60,0:03:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,The storm is almost upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.36,0:03:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then you'd better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.76,0:03:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Everybody works.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.68,0:03:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！What's the matter with you？Huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.00,0:03:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,He said，「We must leave this place immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.32,0:03:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,「If anyone disturbs this tomb…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.04,0:03:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,「The end will come.」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.80,0:03:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,「The end will come.」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.48,0:03:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,We load the trucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.64,0:04:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't help feeling we're making a terrible mistake！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.04,0:04:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're not making a mistake，we're making history！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.88,0:04:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.20,0:04:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,C.J！Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.72,0:04:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,「The end will come.」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.72,0:04:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome，everyone，to the Grand Reopening…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.04,0:04:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,of the newly renovated Hayden Planetarium…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.20,0:04:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,here at the Museum of Natural History.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.12,0:04:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,New York's glitterati have all turned out…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,for what has promised to be a memorable evening…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.40,0:04:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,filled with the dazzling special effects…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.36,0:04:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,and technical wizardry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.54,0:04:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've all come to admire from this museum…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.08,0:04:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,and its renowned Night Program.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.96,0:04:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tonight gonna be fun-fun！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.12,0:04:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here come Dum Dum！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.80,0:04:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，how we doing，Sac？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.20,0:04:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rexy is waxed and buffed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.96,0:05:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Teddy is grooming his moustache.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.04,0:05:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，and I reviewed fire
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.17,0:05:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,safety procedures with the primordial men.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.40,0:05:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,By the way，have you seen them lately？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,The museum has added a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.40,0:05:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.56,0:05:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，and make sure the centurions stretch，all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.88,0:05:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,They really went for it in the dress rehearsal…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.24,0:05:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,and they're just not used to those kinds of dance moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.40,0:05:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，everybody。Everybody，listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.08,0:05:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't want to make anybody nervous…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.40,0:05:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,but the mayor and the governor are both out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.04,0:05:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,And，uh，I'm not 100 percent sure，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.08,0:05:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I think Regis Philbin，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.28,0:05:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Reeju Philbo？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.00,0:05:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，Reeju Philbo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，Rexy，do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.64,0:05:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch the tail，okay？There's gonna be open flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.32,0:05:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Dexter…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.80,0:05:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,how you doing，my man？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.16,0:05:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,All limbered up？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.44,0:05:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looking good。I like the tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.76,0:05:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got kind of a Chippendales thing going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,All chalked up，ready to go？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good。Okay，everybody relax and have fun，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.68,0:05:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You better come see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.12,0:05:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you ever seen it like this before？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.60,0:05:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.68,0:05:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,This corrosion has never happened before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.68,0:05:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's always been exactly the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.28,0:06:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wonder what's up with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.28,0:06:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.96,0:06:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,And to be honest…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.12,0:06:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,my father knew the secrets of the Tablet better than I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.88,0:06:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unfortunately，he swore he'd never reveal them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.80,0:06:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,He never did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.96,0:06:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.56,0:06:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.84,0:06:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.96,0:06:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just take it easy out there tonight，all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.20,0:06:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got 15 minutes till showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.20,0:06:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna figure this out tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.12,0:06:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.52,0:06:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at that！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.32,0:06:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doggone it！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.16,0:06:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you see that？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.32,0:06:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're trying to catch the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.24,0:06:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you can't do it，boys！You can't catch light！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.04,0:06:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's as elusive as human happiness！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.64,0:06:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I should like to comment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Summon the apparatus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.32,0:06:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Summon the apparatus！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.52,0:06:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you gonna say？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.84,0:06:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,L…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.88,0:07:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,O…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.16,0:07:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,L.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.52,0:07:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Laugh out loud.」 Yeah，that's what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.60,0:07:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，post these adorable kittens
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.36,0:07:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,with my edict of approval to Facebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.20,0:07:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give a big Texas 「Hell yeah」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.74,0:07:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,from old Jedediah…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.68,0:07:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,because I loved it too！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.96,0:07:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just send a smiley face.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.24,0:07:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，but with a wink！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.36,0:07:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,A smiley face and a wink！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.76,0:07:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guys，what are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.92,0:07:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're just watching kittens.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.52,0:07:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're on in five minutes。You got to focus，here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.56,0:07:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you we don't have time for this！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.24,0:07:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,You gave it a Texas 「Hell yeah！」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.20,0:07:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Teddy，ready to roll？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.68,0:07:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Indeed，Lawrence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.76,0:07:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Great。- Battle of San Juan Hill…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,cool as a cucumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right now，butterflies like you wouldn't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.56,0:07:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're gonna be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.68,0:07:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lawrence？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.76,0:07:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you seen the Neanderthals lately？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.28,0:07:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Why does everybody keep talking about this？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.04,0:07:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,You may want to give it a look！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.72,0:08:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，guys，what's going on？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.92,0:08:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.68,0:08:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.40,0:08:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's alright，you don't have to come down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay，really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，how are you？I'm Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.60,0:08:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Laaa…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're 「Laaa」？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Laaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.44,0:08:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Laaa。Okay，nice to meet you，Laaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.32,0:08:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome aboard，and…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.44,0:08:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，we look similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.92,0:08:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，we look like each other，I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.92,0:08:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a joke that somebody played.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.28,0:08:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dr。McPhee had you made to look like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.76,0:08:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just a…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.96,0:08:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop it。Stop，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.32,0:08:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dada？- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.28,0:08:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dada.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.44,0:08:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，not your Dada.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.12,0:08:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，Dada.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.28,0:08:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No。Stop。- Dada.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.12,0:08:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dada！- Dada！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.80,0:09:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I'm not his… I'm not your Dada.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.12,0:09:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dum Dum got a new son-son！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.00,0:09:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，he doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.84,0:09:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dada！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dada！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,A toast to our new chairwoman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.88,0:09:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cheers，everyone。Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.04,0:09:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cue the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.96,0:09:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,And Teddy in three，two…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.32,0:09:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Since 1869，when I was a mere boy of 11…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.68,0:09:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,this museum has been a shining beacon to our great city.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.32,0:09:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tonight we'll expand our horizons even further…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.24,0:09:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,to the Sun…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,the Moon，and the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.16,0:09:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,From our very beginning…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,mankind has looked to the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.44,0:09:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,and given names to what he saw，
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.08,0:09:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,the constellations.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.08,0:09:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought you might like to meet them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.60,0:09:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cue the constellations.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.52,0:10:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Orion，the hunter！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.72,0:10:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.92,0:10:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,All planned。All planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.56,0:10:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I knew that was gonna happen。So，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.64,0:10:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good。Going great，guys。Going great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.76,0:10:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's drop the silks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.56,0:10:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,And go with the monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.48,0:10:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.32,0:11:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.52,0:11:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.20,0:11:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you for your patronage…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.64,0:11:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,and for your unwavering support of this fine institution.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.44,0:11:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,This newly renovated planetarium will serve as a lens…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.44,0:11:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Once more unto the breach，dear friends！」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.28,0:11:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.36,0:11:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charge！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.80,0:11:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rough Riders！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.28,0:11:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's okay！Just hang on！- Is this part of it？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.68,0:11:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry folks，a little technical issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.20,0:11:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.40,0:12:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stick to the script。Stick to the script！Huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.24,0:12:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's me！- I don't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pull！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.16,0:12:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know what's come over me，but I like it！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.92,0:12:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drop 'em！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.16,0:12:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's going on？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do something！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.20,0:12:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Orion，don't！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.40,0:13:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rexy！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.12,0:13:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guys，what was going on out there？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.08,0:13:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seriously，what were you thinking？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.72,0:13:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Laaa，I got this，all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.24,0:13:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just… go over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.88,0:13:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，go over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.16,0:13:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.56,0:13:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attila…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.24,0:13:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,what were you doing to that dolphin，man？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.16,0:13:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a dolphin！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.28,0:13:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's one of the most peaceful creatures on earth…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.16,0:13:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,and you're hacking into it like it was The Cove or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.24,0:13:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you see the look on Regis Philbin's face？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.20,0:13:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Reeju？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.24,0:13:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，Reeju.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.76,0:13:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Teddy，what were you doing pointing a gun at me？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.16,0:14:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forgive me，Lawrence。I don't know what came over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.52,0:14:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you even remember that？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.24,0:14:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.00,0:14:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Laaa，shut that down！It's a defibrillator.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.44,0:14:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put it down。It's dangerous！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.28,0:14:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Laaa，that's electricity。Those aren't headphones.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.92,0:14:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop it！What are you…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！Hey！Whoa！Dexter！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.84,0:14:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.64,0:14:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honestly，if you're gonna act like a baby，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.76,0:14:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,then I'll get you some diapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.00,0:14:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want diapers again？Huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.68,0:14:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ease up on the reins there，horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.60,0:14:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can't you see？He feels terrible！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.28,0:14:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hell，we all do！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.92,0:14:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on with everybody here…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.56,0:14:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,but tonight was really weird。Really weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.12,0:14:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,We feel awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.68,0:14:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Something took hold of us like an evil spell！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.12,0:14:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，like we just weren't ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.40,0:14:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hello？- Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.40,0:14:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Dr。McPhee.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.92,0:14:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，hi。How's it going？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.32,0:14:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.60,0:14:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good，good，good，good，good，good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.72,0:15:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know that sound of when you're hiding in a trash bin…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.88,0:15:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,fearing for your life because
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.41,0:15:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,a Tyrannosaurus rex is using it as a Hacky Sack？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.24,0:15:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。I don't know that sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't know that sound？Oh，hold on one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.48,0:15:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the sound！That's the sound！It will haunt my dreams！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.04,0:15:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry。Look，really，I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.48,0:15:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,I swear to you，I had no idea this was going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.92,0:15:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,「I had no idea it was gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.92,0:15:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,「I'm only in charge of all the special effects.」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.92,0:15:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was your fault！They were your special effects！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.88,0:15:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No，I know。- That's a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.00,0:15:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Special effects」？More like 「Special…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.00,0:15:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Defects！」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.88,0:15:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，I promise you，I'm gonna find out what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.96,0:15:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or they were 「Special rejects！」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.80,0:15:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，Dr。McPhee。I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.20,0:15:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nicky！Nicky！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.24,0:15:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop hopping！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.64,0:15:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，what are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.84,0:15:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.00,0:16:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's 3 am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.68,0:16:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，party's over！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.32,0:16:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.52,0:16:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm Sophie。- Sophie？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.88,0:16:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Bye Bye Birdie？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.00,0:16:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Right。- It was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.44,0:16:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thanks。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.60,0:16:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow night？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Probably not。- Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.04,0:16:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Definitely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.04,0:16:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.48,0:16:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're in so much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.64,0:16:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.28,0:16:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't really know you were coming home early.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.16,0:16:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，that's pretty obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.48,0:16:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.16,0:16:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,what makes you think this is okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.96,0:16:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I'm not at Mom's，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.12,0:16:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,you leave me alone，like，every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.44,0:16:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，you can't be doing this right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.32,0:16:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got finals，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.09,0:16:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,your NYU application is due in what，two weeks？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.08,0:16:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna get into NYU.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.60,0:16:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You don't know that。- No，I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.04,0:16:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.32,0:16:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I do very much know that，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.32,0:16:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,in the sense that I don't intend to apply.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.20,0:16:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.40,0:16:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think that it's the place for me right now，Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.92,0:16:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。All right，fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.10,0:16:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want to spread your wings a little…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.56,0:16:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,get out of the city，go to school somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.84,0:16:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ok。I totally support that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.45,0:16:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,All you had to do was tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.24,0:16:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,So where do you want to go？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.40,0:17:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's the list？- It's a short list.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.40,0:17:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great。I like it。Focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.60,0:17:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'mma hit you with a super short list，man，because it's…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.72,0:17:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's nothing on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.56,0:17:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.80,0:17:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm confused，because there's not a list…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.92,0:17:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.80,0:17:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to take a year off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.20,0:17:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I would like to do exactly what you just said.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.12,0:17:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to spread my wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.84,0:17:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want to spread your wings，that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.24,0:17:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you can't spread your wings and fly to nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.80,0:17:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Plans change。- No，they don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.84,0:17:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，they don't。Plans don't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.40,0:17:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,We had a plan，it changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.72,0:17:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's disorienting at first。- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.20,0:17:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't change the plan…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.48,0:17:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,unless you check with the people who are financing the plan…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.52,0:17:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,which is，last time I checked，your mother and I。Okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.56,0:17:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，we could sit here and
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.58,0:17:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,just have this conversation about plans…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.40,0:17:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,but for now，let's call it a night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.96,0:17:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's not even clean up，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.56,0:17:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's come back tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.80,0:17:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's reboot the whole energy，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.16,0:17:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,the whole tone of this puppy…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.64,0:17:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,and we'll kill it，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.72,0:17:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Team Daley！Not tonight，tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.44,0:17:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Team Daley？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.60,0:17:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah？- Stop talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.64,0:17:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.80,0:17:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're gonna clean up。I'm gonna go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.24,0:17:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then we're gonna finish this conversation tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.76,0:18:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！Get some！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.16,0:18:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get some！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.32,0:18:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it。Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.88,0:18:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.40,0:18:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Larry Daley。I'm head of the Night Program.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.52,0:18:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know who you are。You're the security guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.52,0:18:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，also head of the Night Program.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.60,0:18:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm doing some research…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.04,0:18:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I was wondering if you could help me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.36,0:18:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mmm。Night guard doing research.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.52,0:18:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ooh la-la！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.32,0:18:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.60,0:18:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，I'm just looking for anything
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.08,0:18:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,that you might have on the Tablet of Ahkmenrah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.96,0:18:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Center aisle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.16,0:18:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Great。- Halfway down，stacks on your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.24,0:18:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get it！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.48,0:19:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,So…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.16,0:19:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,what makes you so curious about the Tablet？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.96,0:19:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！Just，uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.72,0:19:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just a hobby，you know？Kind of an interest of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.44,0:19:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wish I could talk to these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.96,0:19:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.56,0:19:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.64,0:19:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because they're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.08,0:19:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.20,0:19:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，uh，look at that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.56,0:19:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looks like a kid，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.88,0:19:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You didn't know him，did you？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.00,0:19:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,C.J Fredericks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.16,0:19:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,He worked here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.76,0:19:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,He worked here？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.53,0:19:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，when he grew up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.80,0:19:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.04,0:19:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was a night guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.00,0:19:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Same as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.36,0:19:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a minute。C.J.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.12,0:19:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,C.J Fredericks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.28,0:19:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cecil Fredericks？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.80,0:19:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sexiest night guard we ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.64,0:19:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Present company included.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.64,0:19:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boy，could that man move.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.48,0:20:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.68,0:20:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Cecil.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.16,0:20:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,My God，it's been years！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.84,0:20:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,You look like you're doing pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.44,0:20:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've still got it，pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.52,0:20:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing here？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.88,0:20:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need to talk to you about the Tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.52,0:20:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the heck is Short Stack doing here？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.64,0:20:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Gus。You're looking well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.56,0:20:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Reginald.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.12,0:20:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you here to frame us again？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.28,0:20:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Send us back to the slammer？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.00,0:20:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't frame you。You were actually stealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.12,0:20:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I was the one that got you out of jail，so…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.08,0:20:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。We've got a nice life here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.24,0:20:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,The past is the past。We've moved on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.48,0:20:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think this guy's moved on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.80,0:20:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen to him，monkey face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.64,0:20:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've put all that Tablet stuff behind us，Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.20,0:20:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's old news.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.48,0:20:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Besides，we really never knew anything about that old Tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.44,0:21:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,We just worked there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.88,0:21:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Something's up with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.28,0:21:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you，I can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.20,0:21:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe this kid can.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.60,0:21:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe we'd better talk alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.44,0:21:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Expedition like that is a pretty amazing thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.84,0:21:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,for a 12-year-old boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.44,0:21:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I tried to move on…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.52,0:21:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,but there was something about that Tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.48,0:21:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's turning green，like some sort of corrosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.96,0:21:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,And something's happening to Teddy and Dexter…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.60,0:21:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jed and Octavius.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.80,0:21:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're all acting weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.56,0:21:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's like the green rust is affecting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.92,0:21:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,「The end will come.」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.04,0:21:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.80,0:21:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,The locals，they warned us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.64,0:21:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,They begged us to leave that tomb alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.44,0:21:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought it meant the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.72,0:21:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,But maybe it meant the end…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.32,0:22:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,End of the magic？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.96,0:22:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,We should have listened.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.80,0:22:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Should have listened.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.48,0:22:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Instead，we shipped Ahk and the Tablet off to New York…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.76,0:22:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,and his folks to England.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.76,0:22:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait。Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.16,0:22:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ahkmenrah's parents are in England？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.08,0:22:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was a joint expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.08,0:22:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some of the artifacts stayed in Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.52,0:22:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,The rest was divided up between New York and the British Museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.80,0:22:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ahk said that his father knew the secrets of the Tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.68,0:22:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I have to go talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.56,0:22:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need you to listen to me。Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.24,0:22:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our esteemed chairwoman asked for my resignation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.48,0:22:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,She said，since the Night Program was my brainchild…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.92,0:22:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,that the buck starts and stops with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.64,0:22:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I can fix it。- How？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.00,0:22:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need you to let me take the Tablet and Ahkmenrah to London.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.96,0:22:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry。I'm just processing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.48,0:22:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Input data analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.12,0:22:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've just told you I'm being fired，
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.72,0:22:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,and the first thing you ask…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.20,0:22:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,is if I'd allow you to take some priceless artifacts…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.28,0:22:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,away with you on holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.64,0:23:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes。Please。- No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.04,0:23:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm asking you to please go with me on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.80,0:23:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Nah。- Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.96,0:23:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can't do it，dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.04,0:23:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.68,0:23:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are you gonna mug me？- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.92,0:23:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。Just be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.52,0:23:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I need you to listen to me。- Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.60,0:23:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay？- Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.68,0:23:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You want to know the truth？- Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.48,0:23:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Truth is，the Tablet…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.32,0:23:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Tablet is actually magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.60,0:23:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Things really do come to life at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.64,0:23:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's special effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.45,0:23:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's not special effects。- Of course it's special effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.80,0:23:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,How could it be special effects？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.92,0:23:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,How could it not be special effects？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.08,0:23:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Because it isn't！- Of course it is！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.68,0:23:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm telling you，this is what happens。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.12,0:23:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sun goes down…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.16,0:23:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,the Tablet starts to glow…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.64,0:23:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,everything comes to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.96,0:23:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sure。- It's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.80,0:23:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Tablet starts to glow.」
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.36,0:23:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now I know you're mental.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.36,0:23:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，Leslie…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.64,0:23:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen to me。I'm not gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.80,0:23:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know。Just…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.36,0:23:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.25,0:24:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,nobody cares about this place as much as we do，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.20,0:24:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.44,0:24:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you don't help me…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.64,0:24:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,everything that's special about it might stop…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.60,0:24:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean it may never come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.60,0:24:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not asking you to understand，
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.88,0:24:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm just asking you to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.36,0:24:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd like to help you…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.96,0:24:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I don't even work here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.16,0:24:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,British Museum doesn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.52,0:24:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,The mummy and the Tablet，both.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.80,0:24:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Classic conservation job…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.24,0:24:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,under authority of me，of course…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.04,0:24:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,the director of this museum，which I still am.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.16,0:24:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yep，okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.40,0:24:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.60,0:25:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I really could have just stayed by myself in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.08,0:25:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。No，that wasn't gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.56,0:25:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Beautiful，huh？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.16,0:25:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,The River Thames.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.60,0:25:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isn't this cool，man，
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.90,0:25:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,you and me in London？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.64,0:25:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Huh？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.84,0:25:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，I've been thinking about that，uh，year off.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.88,0:25:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.32,0:25:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think it could be cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.40,0:25:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.20,0:25:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you thinking？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.40,0:25:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Uh… Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.36,0:25:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I want to DJ in lbiza.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.00,0:25:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,In lbiza？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.16,0:25:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,lbiza，it's a small island off the coast of Spain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.84,0:25:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do you speak Spanish？- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.76,0:25:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,But that's the beautiful thing。It's about the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.88,0:25:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not inhibited by the language barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.08,0:25:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，but you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.92,0:25:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you speak in beats？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.47,0:25:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why are you freaking out？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.36,0:25:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just said this was a really cool idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.00,0:25:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not freaking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.20,0:25:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just want to understand what the plan is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.04,0:26:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,You didn't go to college.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.92,0:26:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，now we're talking about not going to college at all？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.68,0:26:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Maybe。I don't know。- Nicky.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.20,0:26:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nicky。That's not…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.76,0:26:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，you didn't go to college。You turned out fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.72,0:26:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I turned out okay after about 20 years
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.00,0:26:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,in a lot of dead ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.16,0:26:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whatever，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.88,0:26:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me。It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.08,0:26:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，I'm always gonna worry about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.72,0:26:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm your dad。- Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.36,0:26:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sun is going down。We should get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.88,0:26:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.52,0:26:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，what's the plan here，anyway？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.24,0:26:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,When the Tablet brings Ahkmenrah to life，
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.77,0:26:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,he's gonna sneak us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.88,0:26:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Now，get down。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.04,0:26:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just get down！Come on，man。Part of the adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.52,0:26:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello。Welcome to the British Museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.52,0:26:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,My name's Tilly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.68,0:26:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.00,0:27:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Larry Daley from Natural History，New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.28,0:27:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah，yeah。- I got a delivery…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.80,0:27:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,for your conservation department.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.76,0:27:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.60,0:27:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,So they let you travel？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.16,0:27:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is kind of unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.44,0:27:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，they let me travel。You know where？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.80,0:27:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No。- Home。Here。Home.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.72,0:27:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.08,0:27:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Off to the toot-toot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.92,0:27:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Five-minute maximum.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.72,0:27:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,So that must be well wicked being a security guard in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.96,0:27:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Uh… - With your gun，with a silencer，
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.72,0:27:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,with your ninja swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.88,0:27:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.88,0:27:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's not even a little bit true.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.88,0:27:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,The only thing that I got is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.92,0:27:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh。- Hammer！It's for…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.96,0:27:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I quote，
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.27,0:27:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Minor repairs and beautifications」
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.40,0:27:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,to the shack.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.68,0:27:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just hit things？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.64,0:27:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，that's catchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.32,0:27:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Basically worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.76,0:27:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't believe we're actually still talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.44,0:27:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's great，though，innit？- It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.24,0:27:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is the most conversation I've had
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.08,0:27:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,in the three years that I've worked here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.88,0:28:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I feel a connection，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.84,0:28:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is it cool if I just make my drop？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.16,0:28:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，yeah。- Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.00,0:28:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I will have to confirm.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.80,0:28:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，that's not necessary…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.16,0:28:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,because they've already confirmed it on the slip I gave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.12,0:28:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，all right。Confirming.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.96,0:28:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay。- All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.52,0:28:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello。This is Dr。McPhee.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.40,0:28:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the British Museum，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.24,0:28:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm just confirming a delivery to our conservation department.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.44,0:28:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，I signed the paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.24,0:28:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，if you'll excuse me，I have a museum to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.32,0:28:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,You，boy，get those grubby fingers off my Ming vase.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.64,0:28:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,See？Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.72,0:28:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.92,0:28:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good？- All right，you is legit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.00,0:28:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I is legit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.64,0:28:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Wonderful。- Confirm it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.32,0:28:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thank you。- All right，I'll open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.88,0:28:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.96,0:28:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，so，like，my boyfriend…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.84,0:28:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,he doesn't really like the way I do my hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.72,0:28:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Says it looks like a golden poo sitting on my shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.52,0:28:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I really enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.28,0:28:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bye，Larry！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.24,0:29:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not an expert…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.44,0:29:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,but this is feeling，just，really against the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.24,0:29:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，they have a totally different legal system here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.24,0:29:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.48,0:29:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,How we doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.60,0:29:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,All clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.76,0:29:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.32,0:29:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry，the others felt，perhaps，we could use some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.56,0:29:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,The others？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.00,0:30:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lawrence，I couldn't sit idly by.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.88,0:30:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our very survival is at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.60,0:30:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Hey，Teddy。Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.64,0:30:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good man to have in a crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.96,0:30:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attila.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.44,0:30:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，a little muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.44,0:30:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.52,0:30:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is a deceptively large box.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.24,0:30:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Obviously，we came along，too！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.40,0:30:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know you'd be lost without us，Gigantor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.48,0:30:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you serious？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.12,0:30:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,And the monkey。All right，basically everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.44,0:30:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dada！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.52,0:30:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！No，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.20,0:30:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,No possible benefit whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.12,0:30:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,He really wanted to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.76,0:30:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，this is my son…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.96,0:30:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,my actual son，Nicky.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.80,0:30:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Nicky，this is Laaa。- What's up？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.80,0:30:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's just tracking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.60,0:30:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Laaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.56,0:30:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，Lawrence…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.72,0:30:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,what's the plan of attack？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.96,0:30:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,We need to get to the Egyptian wing，find Ahk's father…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.52,0:30:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,and hopefully get the Tablet fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.64,0:31:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,All of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.72,0:31:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Laaa，that's not for eating。That's not food.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.00,0:31:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.40,0:31:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what？I got a job for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.24,0:31:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.88,0:31:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.04,0:31:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you to stay here and watch this door，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.04,0:31:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Make sure nobody comes in or out。Okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.56,0:31:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good。You're gonna be a guard，just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.44,0:31:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.32,0:31:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.84,0:31:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay here…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.52,0:31:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,and put your hands on the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.72,0:31:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good，stay。- Stay！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.92,0:31:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good。That's right。You stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.80,0:31:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.16,0:31:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay。Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.80,0:31:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.84,0:31:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stay！- Stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.36,0:31:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look there。Good。Stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.04,0:31:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Good。Stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.88,0:31:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.36,0:31:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.64,0:31:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't… Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.28,0:31:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.32,0:31:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Good。Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.80,0:31:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，listen up，guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.44,0:31:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,This place is waking up for the first time…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.08,0:32:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,and we have no idea what's out there，
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.15,0:32:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,so stay together，all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.88,0:32:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know it's spooky，big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.28,0:32:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.96,0:32:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,What kind of haunted hootenanny is this，boys？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.08,0:32:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're all finding this super creepy，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.16,0:32:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're just a little freaked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.96,0:32:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,First time we came alive it took some getting used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.92,0:32:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，there。Just heading to Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.72,0:32:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.16,0:33:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hear that？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.64,0:33:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hear what？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.64,0:33:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,That.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.96,0:33:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll just be down here if anyone needs us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.84,0:33:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're not scared。It's just more comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.28,0:33:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lawrence…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.52,0:33:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think it's safe to say that we're in a bit of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.00,0:33:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know how to handle this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.12,0:33:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,You mind？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.32,0:33:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.04,0:33:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad。What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.48,0:33:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do you think I tamed your pal Rexy？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.00,0:33:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.28,0:33:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I bet you're not so mean，are you？Huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.92,0:33:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I bet you're not so mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.88,0:33:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，you're just a little puppy，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.60,0:33:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're just a little puppy who wants to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.36,0:33:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want to play，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.20,0:33:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Want to play fetch？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.36,0:33:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.56,0:33:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want to play with this bone？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.24,0:33:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah！Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.32,0:33:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here you go。Go fetch.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.16,0:33:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go fetch！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.84,0:34:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Lawrence？- Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.64,0:34:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- May I suggest a different plan？- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.12,0:34:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Run！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.72,0:34:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Close it，close it！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.04,0:34:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。I think we're…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.80,0:34:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get back！Everybody，get back！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.72,0:34:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。You don't want to fetch？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.88,0:34:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Fetch on this。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.60,0:35:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，that's close！- Need some help？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.44,0:35:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.36,0:35:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attila，you okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.88,0:35:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You might want to… - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.76,0:35:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.16,0:35:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,hold this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.28,0:35:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK。That was actually very cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.96,0:35:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir Lancelot，at your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.24,0:35:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you。That was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.12,0:36:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Theodore Roosevelt…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.32,0:36:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,President of the United States of America.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.48,0:36:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have no idea what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.36,0:36:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Larry，and this is my son，Nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.96,0:36:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have a noble face，Nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.60,0:36:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thanks。- Thanks for the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.84,0:36:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，you…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.68,0:36:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,You remind me of a man I once knew at Camelot.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.20,0:36:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.44,0:36:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,One of the Knights of the Round Table？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.56,0:36:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Erik.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.80,0:36:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Erik？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.76,0:36:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.12,0:36:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was the funniest fool I ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.48,0:36:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was so good，he didn't even have to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.60,0:36:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,He could just walk into a room and you'd laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.92,0:36:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.80,0:36:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You have what he had。The gift。- That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.76,0:36:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You could be a fool。- I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.76,0:36:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，come on，of course you could！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.08,0:36:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'd get you one of those
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.57,0:36:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,hats with the funny little dangly bells.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.44,0:36:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dangly bells？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.88,0:36:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Dangly bells.」
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.16,0:36:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you？The gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.08,0:36:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,He does what seems like nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.36,0:36:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,A sort of deadpan…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.88,0:36:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,tiny little…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.44,0:36:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Expressionless，you know，sort of a…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.00,0:36:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.16,0:37:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just like Erik.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.72,0:37:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sounds like a great guy。We got to get going，so…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.16,0:37:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，Camelot.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.36,0:37:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.48,0:37:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someday，I shall return to its mighty towers…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.00,0:37:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,to King Arthur…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.92,0:37:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,and Queen Guinevere.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.44,0:37:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sweet…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.60,0:37:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,beauteous Guinevere.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.60,0:37:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I'm sworn not to until I have completed my quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.56,0:37:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I must find the Holy Grail.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.80,0:37:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.20,0:37:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,And thanks for the help again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.52,0:37:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got to get to Egypt，so we'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.20,0:37:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I will lead you。- No，it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.92,0:37:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Halt，Dangly Bells！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.28,0:37:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,There is strange magic in the air，
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.16,0:37:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,and dangerous beasts are afoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.16,0:37:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is the duty of a true knight…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.20,0:37:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,to protect and care for those in need.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.84,0:37:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're off.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.64,0:37:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess he's coming with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.72,0:37:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.16,0:37:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jed and Octavius？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.24,0:37:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,They must have fallen out while we were running.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.04,0:37:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jed？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.16,0:37:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Octavius！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.24,0:38:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jedediah！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.28,0:38:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jed！Octo！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.08,0:38:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.88,0:38:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that Octavius's cape？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.56,0:38:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.76,0:38:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Nicky。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.04,0:38:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guys？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.76,0:38:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gigantor！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.68,0:38:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jed？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.12,0:38:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,They won't last long in those heating vents，Lawrence.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.40,0:38:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,At their size，they'll
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.86,0:38:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,bake like tiny little scarabs in the Sinai.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.72,0:38:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Too dark？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.32,0:39:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is the end，boy！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.20,0:39:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is the last roundup！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.40,0:39:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold my hand！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.32,0:39:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.84,0:39:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.92,0:39:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're a long way from home，boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.36,0:39:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you ask me to hold your hand？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.84,0:39:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.96,0:39:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.92,0:39:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jedo！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.40,0:39:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Octo！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.20,0:39:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,They could be anywhere between here and the intake vent.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.00,0:40:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you see，Dex？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.28,0:40:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know he's a monkey，Lawrence.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.68,0:40:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,He can't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.00,0:40:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，but he can fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.00,0:40:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nicky… give me your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.04,0:40:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why？- For Dex.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.36,0:40:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't understand one thing that's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.20,0:40:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。I don't，either。Dad，what's going on？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.96,0:40:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sort of set up to track your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.00,0:40:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're sort of set up to track my phone？You track my phone？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.48,0:40:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I'm your dad。I'm looking out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.20,0:40:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。No。Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.40,0:40:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Spying on」 is not the same thing
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.56,0:40:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,as just looking out for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.20,0:40:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll get it back，I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.60,0:40:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,But right now，it's going on the monkey's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.24,0:40:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Dex，come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.64,0:40:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.00,0:40:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen。I need you to go down there and find them，all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.96,0:40:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Think you can handle it？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.84,0:40:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.04,0:40:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.16,0:41:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think it's right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.64,0:41:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Right here.」
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.88,0:41:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Classic.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.64,0:41:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，the gift of laughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.76,0:41:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Dangly Bells.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.28,0:41:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,First quest？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.92,0:41:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.48,0:41:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought you were going to Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.20,0:41:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,We are，but we got to do this first.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.16,0:41:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's not how a quest works.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.60,0:41:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,A quest is one thing。It's not，like，「Holy Grail and a monkey.」
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.16,0:41:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，well，my guys are missing
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.28,0:41:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,and Dexter's gonna find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.64,0:41:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is the quest？Gold？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.96,0:41:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fountain of Youth？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.52,0:41:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Magic Tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.60,0:42:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's that thing Ahk is holding.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.92,0:42:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be too hard to take it from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.96,0:42:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,He seems well-toned and lean…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.00,0:42:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,but weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.64,0:42:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,It would be like taking candy from a feeble Egyptian baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.24,0:42:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，we're not trying to take it。We're trying to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.12,0:42:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's something wrong with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.88,0:42:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's kind of complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.68,0:42:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,It might be less complicated
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.34,0:42:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,if you stopped following a chimpanzee.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.76,0:42:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's not a chimpanzee。He's a capuchin.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.48,0:42:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,The fool seems agitated.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.00,0:42:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's often his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.56,0:42:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I assure you，he's no fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.64,0:42:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is it true what he says？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.04,0:42:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Tablet that you carry is magic？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.92,0:42:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is，indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.52,0:42:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everything around you has
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.80,0:42:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,come to life tonight for the very first time…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.36,0:42:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,all because of this Tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.52,0:42:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.16,0:42:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then they're not real？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.52,0:42:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're as real as any of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.64,0:42:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，but we're real people.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.48,0:43:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're just things.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.36,0:43:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,And they don't even know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.16,0:43:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,They must be unbelievably stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.68,0:43:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,It can be confusing at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.44,0:43:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，frog！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.28,0:43:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep hopping！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.60,0:43:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're real！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.00,0:43:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guys，I think we're gonna have to cut through Asia.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.96,0:43:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.12,0:43:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,None.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.48,0:43:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't really see much.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.36,0:43:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,We could jump down，hope for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.84,0:43:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,But we have no idea what's down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.28,0:43:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't know what's up here，either.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.48,0:44:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is a Roman city.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.44,0:44:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can feel the familiar pull of history in its very foundations.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.52,0:44:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where the heck is everybody？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.12,0:44:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've seen this town before，I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.56,0:44:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Romans？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.76,0:44:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I see you have the name of a lady on your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.52,0:44:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Andrea。Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.56,0:44:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,So this Lady Andrea is your Guinevere.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.84,0:44:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Does any man stand between you and your ladylove？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.76,0:44:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，actually。My dad kind of messed things up the other night.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.56,0:44:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Nick。- Oh，we're stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.36,0:44:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let no man stand between you and your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.80,0:44:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，「Destiny」 may be overstating it a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.80,0:44:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,We just have calculus together.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.44,0:44:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's more one of those…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.88,0:44:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,fleeting moments of eye contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.52,0:44:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Who's gonna look away first？」
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.76,0:44:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I get you，yeah，「No man…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.04,0:44:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good。Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.40,0:45:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Liepwop.」
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.84,0:45:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Liepwop.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.08,0:45:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doesn't ring a bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.92,0:45:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now who's this son of a gun？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.52,0:45:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Pompeii！- I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.80,0:45:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm having trouble hearing you！- Pompeii！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.44,0:45:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,No comprendo，amigo…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.04,0:45:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,because you got the thing in front of you！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.96,0:45:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are they doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.04,0:45:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where in the blazes are they stampeding off to？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.12,0:45:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Was it something we said？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.04,0:45:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on back to liepwop！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.64,0:45:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's plenty of room！Come on back！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.20,0:45:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're as crazy as road lizards.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.00,0:45:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,People are strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.44,0:45:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，guy，We're just passing through.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.28,0:45:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a Garuda from Tibet.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.45,0:45:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,A Garuda？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.52,0:45:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，Garuda。How you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.44,0:45:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Garuda！How you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.76,0:45:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cool，great.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.96,0:46:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。We just…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.60,0:46:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what？We just got to get through。I don't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.12,0:46:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please。Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.64,0:46:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna play this game with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.96,0:46:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got to go through。Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.68,0:46:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.96,0:46:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- A dragon。- No，it's not a dragon。It's a…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.88,0:46:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a Xiangliu.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.96,0:46:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mythical snake demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.04,0:46:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,It looks like a dragon。I say we kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.16,0:46:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？No，it's asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.16,0:46:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.50,0:46:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not very sporting to kill it while it's asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.40,0:46:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's wake it up and then kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.92,0:46:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I shall go first，and I shall take the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.80,0:46:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you…？No！You're not gonna take the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.84,0:46:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why not？- Because he's a boy！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.00,0:46:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry，there comes a time in every man's life…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.64,0:46:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,when he must slay his own dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.24,0:46:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not this kid，all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.44,0:46:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,He still hasn't finished
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.22,0:46:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,all his thank-you notes from his bar mitzvah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.76,0:47:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anyway，that's just an expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.72,0:47:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not where I come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.84,0:47:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's not gonna slay his dragon right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.84,0:47:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna go around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.28,0:47:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna go around now，or else we're gonna lose the signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.28,0:47:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.96,0:47:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,liepwop.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.28,0:47:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pompeii！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.72,0:47:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,liepwop。Are you sure you're reading that right，pal？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.12,0:47:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pompeii！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.80,0:47:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Pompeii.」
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.12,0:48:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Ask not what your country can do for you…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.48,0:48:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Ask what you can do for your country.」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.64,0:48:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,There it goes again！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.00,0:48:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attila！Shh！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.44,0:48:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Teddy！- Charge！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.52,0:48:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fantastic！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.60,0:48:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's awake！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.72,0:48:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now we can kill it！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.88,0:48:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.36,0:48:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nicky！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.24,0:48:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll get the boy！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.52,0:48:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ever used a blade？- Only in World of Warcraft！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.72,0:48:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're about to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.72,0:49:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,「The only thing we have to fear is fear itself！」
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.00,0:49:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Doing a heck of a job，Brownie.」
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.16,0:49:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Behind you！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.40,0:49:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Duck！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.68,0:49:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Last roundup，kemosabe！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.64,0:50:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Time to slap on the barbecue sauce，boy！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.20,0:50:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Huh？What？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.48,0:50:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no！You wouldn't！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.08,0:50:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,He must！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.52,0:50:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Clear！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.44,0:51:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,We must never speak of what happened here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.40,0:51:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！That wasn't necessary！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.16,0:51:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's out！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.32,0:51:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,These things really do save lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.52,0:51:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.08,0:51:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you all right，my dear？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.00,0:51:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You okay？- Yeah，thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.32,0:51:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,You fought bravely，sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.20,0:51:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,One day，I promise you，
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.52,0:51:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,we shall drink dragon's blood from the victor's cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.68,0:51:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm good with just，like，soda or water，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.76,0:51:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I like the energy we got going.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.88,0:51:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,From now on，you must choose your own path.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.88,0:51:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,And let no man tell you otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.20,0:51:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,We better let Larry know we're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.72,0:51:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.36,0:51:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry's probably worried about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.00,0:52:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,How are we going to find them now？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.40,0:52:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lawrence？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.12,0:52:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I fear we've turned a corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.08,0:52:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm becoming wax again，son.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.88,0:52:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。We'll look for them later.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.36,0:52:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got to get to Egypt now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.64,0:52:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，shouldn't we keep looking for Jed and Octavius？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.44,0:52:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nick is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.76,0:52:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,A true knight never shirks his duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.12,0:52:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,If we don't get to Egypt soon we're not gonna save anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.20,0:52:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dada say，「Stay！」
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.32,0:52:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.00,0:52:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dada say Laaa no eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.12,0:53:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay，Laaa！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.24,0:53:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.32,0:53:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perhaps I should accompany you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.28,0:53:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I think we got it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.36,0:53:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Really？- Yeah。No，we're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.56,0:53:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.96,0:53:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,friends…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.16,0:53:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.24,0:53:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,clown-faced keeper of the magic Tablet…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.60,0:53:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I shall never forget your bravery.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.36,0:53:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nor your jests.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.52,0:53:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.88,0:53:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I shall not say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.68,0:53:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I am。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.80,0:53:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna say goodbye。I have to go，I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.36,0:53:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.56,0:53:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really，man，thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.28,0:53:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,For everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.52,0:53:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I haven't seen these walls for many a moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.28,0:54:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ahkmen？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.68,0:54:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.28,0:54:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.28,0:54:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome home，my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.36,0:54:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you to meet my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.84,0:54:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am Merenkahre…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.84,0:54:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pharaoh of the Nile and Father to the Son of the Sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.92,0:54:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I am Shepseheret…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.32,0:54:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,the Glittering Jewel of the Nine Kingdoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.44,0:54:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I am Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.96,0:54:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guardian of Brooklyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.44,0:54:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.64,0:54:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I actually live in Manhattan now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.44,0:54:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know，but it doesn't sound as cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.72,0:54:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,We would be very honored
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.08,0:54:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,if you could take a look at the Tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.64,0:54:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's something happening with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.80,0:54:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't understand what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.24,0:54:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are speaking with a pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.88,0:54:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kiss my staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.16,0:55:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is it okay if I don't？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.44,0:55:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,You will show respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.28,0:55:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am the descendant of Ra，the sun god.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.72,0:55:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I understand that and I totally respect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.96,0:55:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just don't pray to Ra，so…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.40,0:55:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Egyptian gods are the only true gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.16,0:55:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，we try to stay a little more open-minded.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.08,0:55:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，Sacajawea，she honors her spiritual ancestors…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.96,0:55:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,and you pray to some sort of goat god，Attila？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.64,0:55:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm half-lrish，half-Jewish…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.48,0:55:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are？I love Jews！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.68,0:55:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,We owned 40，000 of them！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.52,0:55:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Such lovely people。- Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.88,0:55:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,They were very happy，always singing with the candles.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.60,0:55:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。They really weren't happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.96,0:55:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Really？- No。They left.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.00,0:55:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,They spent about 40 years in the desert trying to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.88,0:55:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。We have dinner once a year and talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.76,0:55:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a big deal for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.56,0:55:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，could you take a look at that Tablet？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.92,0:55:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's something wrong with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.68,0:56:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's losing its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.20,0:56:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you think you could fix it？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.72,0:56:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,To do that，I would have to divulge the secret of the Tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.64,0:56:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I promise we won't tell anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.72,0:56:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.44,0:56:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll kiss your staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.80,0:56:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.44,0:56:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Father，why do you insist on keeping this to yourself？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.96,0:56:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,The secret was to be passed down to you at the proper time.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.52,0:56:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，it has been 4，000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.52,0:56:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now seems like a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.80,0:56:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were born at midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.36,0:56:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was Pharaoh…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.80,0:56:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I had seen wonders most men only dream of.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.52,0:56:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,But when I first gazed upon you…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.36,0:56:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,you were instantly more precious to me…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.20,0:56:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,than all the wonders of the ancient world.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.28,0:56:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I knew I could never bear to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.52,0:56:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I commanded the High Priest to create a gift to you，my son…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.16,0:57:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,using all we had learned of the mysteries of the afterlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.24,0:57:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forged in the temple of Khonsu，god of the moon…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.04,0:57:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,and watcher over nighttime travelers…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.88,0:57:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,the Tablet of Ahkmenrah.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.60,0:57:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our tomb was designed to
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.00,0:57:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,channel Khonsu's rays down to the Tablet…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.68,0:57:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,rejuvenating its powers every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.60,0:57:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,The moon god bestowed his power upon the Tablet…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.48,0:57:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,so that，as long as it bathed in his light…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.44,0:57:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,our family could be together forever，
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.76,0:57:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,and not even death could part us.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.56,0:57:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's been away from Khonsu's light too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.20,0:57:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,My son！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.64,0:57:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is happening to you？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.56,0:57:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,It needs moonlight…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.88,0:57:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,otherwise we shall all be dead by sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.44,0:57:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hurry！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.28,0:57:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,If the Tablet dies…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.80,0:58:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,nothing can bring it back！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.20,0:58:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.40,0:58:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Tablet。Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.64,0:58:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，listen to me。That thing is dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.96,0:58:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,If it doesn't get moonlight…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.68,0:58:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,everything ends，like，for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.64,0:58:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,King Arthur wasted years searching for the Holy Grail.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.00,0:58:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,To think it was a Tablet all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.80,0:58:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Would you just give it to me？You don't know what you're doing！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.76,0:58:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,My quest is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.48,0:58:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,I ride for Camelot tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.92,0:58:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just keep it，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.40,0:58:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,But just put it in the moonlight
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.64,0:58:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,and turn that center piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.12,0:58:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，not my first quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.04,0:58:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,And by the way，Erik was much funnier than you！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.28,0:58:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go get the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.24,0:58:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can't let him leave the building！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.48,0:59:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa！Easy there，partner！Slow it down！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.04,0:59:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.56,0:59:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I'm pretty dang sure that Tablet don't belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.28,0:59:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now wait a second！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.80,0:59:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come back here！This ain't over！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.16,0:59:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll rue the day you mocked us with your huge sword
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.08,0:59:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,and hypnotic blue eyes！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.48,0:59:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,His eyes are very blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.00,0:59:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Speak softly and carry a big stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.20,0:59:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lawrence，we have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.04,0:59:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,This one turned to wax as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.12,0:59:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have a saying，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.48,0:59:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Speak loudly and carry a bigger stick.」
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.32,1:00:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's over there！- You mean up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.24,1:00:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.24,1:00:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.32,1:00:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Teddy。- The Tablet，now！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.04,1:00:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I shan't ask you again，fool！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.28,1:00:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,And this is giving me a headache！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.84,1:00:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me the Tablet！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.72,1:00:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me go，Lawrence.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.04,1:00:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！Teddy，no！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.68,1:00:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Teddy！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.56,1:00:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.24,1:01:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,That'll be mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.84,1:01:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，that was a good one.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.20,1:01:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,No idea that would work.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.60,1:01:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.80,1:01:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，you guys，how you doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.84,1:01:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Still in one piece that can ensure！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.08,1:01:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Octavius，I think this belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.64,1:01:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.32,1:01:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.56,1:01:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why is Lancelot staying strong while we get weaker？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.84,1:01:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's his first night.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.04,1:01:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Newborns are stronger but it matters not.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.72,1:01:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unless we succeed，he，too，will be dead come the dawn.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.60,1:01:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can't let him leave the building.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.80,1:01:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，can you go back to Egypt，in case he comes through there？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.76,1:01:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Of course。- Nicky，take Attila，check the loading dock.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.68,1:01:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Got it。- Teddy，go to the South Wing，cover the side doors.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.84,1:01:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got the main entrance.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.44,1:02:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,You！I knew you smelled a bit off！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.44,1:02:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Didn't you just see that？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.60,1:02:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,See what？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.92,1:02:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,The knight on the horse that just rode through！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.56,1:02:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop trying to distract me with your magical fantasy！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.96,1:02:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I found your filthy twin，here，in the freight room！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.52,1:02:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's not my twin.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.04,1:02:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got him，and what could he say for himself？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.56,1:02:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut up！Shut up in your face！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.16,1:02:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut up right now！Do you want to be smashed？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.16,1:02:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，you can run，but if you leave those gates…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.80,1:02:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I swear to you，your hideous doppelganger…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.08,1:02:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,who looks a lot like the lead singer of the Counting Crows…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.68,1:02:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,will get it！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.40,1:02:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dada.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.64,1:02:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.80,1:02:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,It compute with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.40,1:02:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dada.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.48,1:02:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn it！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.88,1:02:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Laaa.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.96,1:02:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you see me do something dumb，don't imitate me，okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.20,1:02:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's basically what I keep telling Nick.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.52,1:02:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,He just doesn't get it，you know？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.32,1:03:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，he's a smart kid…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.88,1:03:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I just want to give him the tools that I didn't have.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.36,1:03:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，get the degree，then take a break.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.44,1:03:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get the degree，then take a break.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.44,1:03:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Laaa！Laaa，stop that！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.52,1:03:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop it！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.72,1:03:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.08,1:03:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？Excuse me！Hey！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.16,1:03:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi。Hey。Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.00,1:03:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Nick，this is Dexter，Attila the Hun.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.48,1:03:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yes，so lovely to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.08,1:03:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now meet this hammer！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.36,1:04:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.84,1:04:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm super sorry。I know it's a
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.40,1:04:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,lot going on，Hun，monkey.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.00,1:04:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow，what？So much weird。Huge amount to process.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.92,1:04:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right？Okay，sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.52,1:04:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thank you。- You won't get away with this！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.44,1:04:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm making sketches of you in my mind right now！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.60,1:04:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boy with freckles，
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.40,1:04:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,fat Asian with hair extensions，evil monkey.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.36,1:04:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess it's just parenting，you know？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.52,1:04:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,And he comes from a divorced family…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.08,1:04:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,so I'm sure he has a lot of conflicted feelings about me…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.96,1:04:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,and there might be some Oedipal stuff at play in there，or…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.80,1:04:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.96,1:04:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wasn't there a lot of the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.28,1:04:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,So I think I might be projecting my own guilt…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.56,1:04:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,and taking it out on him in ways…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.28,1:04:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,that I'm not even aware of.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.96,1:04:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.56,1:04:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Door.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.28,1:04:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Head.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.16,1:04:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，I…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.32,1:04:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Open…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.28,1:05:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,head.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.72,1:05:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Open your mind！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.48,1:05:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！Yeah，well，you're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.24,1:05:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the challenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.48,1:05:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，it's all contextual，and I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.00,1:05:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I keep looking at him
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.24,1:05:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,through the lens of how my parents raised me…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.84,1:05:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,when，in reality，he's his own person.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.16,1:05:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,And，yeah，we share the same DNA…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.48,1:05:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,but honestly，he's much more evolved than I ever was.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.16,1:05:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't want to let my own ego and childhood history…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.00,1:05:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,stop him from making the mistakes he needs to make…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.16,1:05:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,to become the person that he's meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.48,1:05:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Open the door with your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.00,1:05:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.12,1:05:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good，Laaa。Let's go！Ah！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.08,1:05:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Everybody okay？- Yes，Lawrence.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.68,1:05:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attila and your boy secured the lady guard in her booth.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.04,1:05:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know how long it will hold her，though.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.76,1:05:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,We gotta find Lancelot…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.00,1:05:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,but somebody has to make sure she doesn't get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.96,1:05:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Laaa，okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.00,1:05:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what you have to do？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.96,1:05:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.12,1:05:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right。Just make sure she stays in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.04,1:05:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stay！- Good！Go！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.04,1:05:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dada say，「Stay」！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.88,1:05:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lawrence！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.04,1:06:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't move my arms.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.36,1:06:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're becoming less useful by the minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.28,1:06:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，big guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.56,1:06:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？You okay there？Huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.96,1:06:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Something's up with your eye，but…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.04,1:06:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。It's just kind of going…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.96,1:06:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,You gotta relax，okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.40,1:06:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Calm down！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.72,1:06:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attila！Attila！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.68,1:06:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attila doesn't hyperventilate.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.04,1:06:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,You pillage！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.88,1:06:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,You plunder！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.84,1:06:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't freak out.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.40,1:06:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.00,1:06:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，there's，like，8 million people in this city.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.68,1:06:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,He could be literally anywhere by now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.72,1:06:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll find him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.08,1:06:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.00,1:06:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm coming，my love.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.60,1:07:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blimey！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.28,1:07:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,He came this way…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.44,1:07:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,traveling 4 leagues per hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.92,1:07:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.08,1:07:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Never run from a big cat，Lawrence.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.60,1:07:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gigantor，get your flashlight out！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.60,1:07:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,These cats want to play！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.12,1:07:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoo-wee！He's got it，boy！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.04,1:07:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well played，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.88,1:07:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Run！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.64,1:07:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where the devil could Lancelot be？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.44,1:07:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.16,1:08:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You better let me out of here，you revolting ape-man！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.76,1:08:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you staring at？Stop looking at me！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.32,1:08:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you never seen a beautiful，
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.96,1:08:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,attractive，gorgeous woman before…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.64,1:08:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,who could be a model if she didn't love pizza so much？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.68,1:08:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know what you're playing at…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.44,1:08:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,and it ain't working.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.80,1:08:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not working.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.32,1:08:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，it is kind of working.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.52,1:08:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,What have they done to Camelot？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.56,1:08:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,In short，there's simply not
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.72,1:08:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,a more congenial spot
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.68,1:08:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,for happily ever-aftering
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.56,1:08:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,than here in…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.32,1:09:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Camelot
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.40,1:09:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,At long last！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.04,1:09:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Guinevere，my love。- Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.48,1:09:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can I help you，mate？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.08,1:09:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is I…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.64,1:09:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir Lancelot.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.88,1:09:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have fulfilled my quest.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.72,1:09:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry。I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.36,1:09:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not actually Guinevere.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.56,1:09:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Alice Eve，and I think you got a bit confused.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.00,1:09:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe you saw me on stage…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.80,1:09:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your voice is like music…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.00,1:09:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I have no idea what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.92,1:09:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.48,1:09:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.04,1:09:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，buddy。Um…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.76,1:09:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,What she's saying is she's not Guinevere because she's an actor.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.84,1:09:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay？So am l.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.84,1:09:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,An actor？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.08,1:09:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.24,1:09:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.60,1:09:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do the crown.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.76,1:09:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，sorry，of course。Hugh Jackman.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.08,1:09:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was the crown.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.44,1:09:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know，the whole…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.92,1:09:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Huge Ackman？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.84,1:09:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh… That's a ridiculous name！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.44,1:09:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,It doesn't even sound real！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.76,1:09:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only a coward would conceal his true identity，Arthur.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.28,1:09:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，it's Hugh Jackman.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.76,1:09:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I，on the other hand…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.04,1:09:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,carry the treasure you sought…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.76,1:09:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,but could never find.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.56,1:10:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Behold the key to life everlasting！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.96,1:10:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，I love the costume…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.56,1:10:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love the enthusiasm…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.76,1:10:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,but you're gonna have to get off stage now.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.64,1:10:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir Lancelot，ladies and gentlemen。Sir Lancelot.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.96,1:10:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.16,1:10:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.36,1:10:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shame on you，Arthur！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.48,1:10:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't deserve your crown，
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.12,1:10:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,and you don't deserve your queen！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.08,1:10:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Prepare to feel the cold kiss of my blade…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.92,1:10:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Huge Ackman！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.12,1:10:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，buddy，this is all pretend.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.80,1:10:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,See，just…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.08,1:10:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，that's not real.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.72,1:10:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,None of it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.60,1:10:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not real.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.92,1:10:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was a good performance.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.12,1:10:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We were right in there。- You were tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.96,1:10:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,But it's not real-real.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.28,1:10:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not real.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.40,1:10:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not real？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.84,1:10:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you know how long I dreamed of Camelot？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.84,1:11:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,And for what？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.96,1:11:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,For nothing！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.40,1:11:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jeez！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.28,1:11:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.84,1:11:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no。Please just take your seats and…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.76,1:11:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's up？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.68,1:11:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're just as God made us.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.52,1:11:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't you take a picture？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.16,1:11:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,It'll last longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.44,1:11:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，I've tried being nice。That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.68,1:11:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get off the stage right now！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.64,1:11:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay back！You don't scare me…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.60,1:11:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Huge Ackman.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.72,1:11:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，mate，you don't want to fight me，all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.56,1:11:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,If we go，I will break you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.48,1:11:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.40,1:11:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is that？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.84,1:11:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.00,1:11:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's doing his Wolverine thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.44,1:11:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.52,1:11:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。You know？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.00,1:11:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's better with the claws and no shirt.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.88,1:11:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fair.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.20,1:12:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lancelot！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.56,1:12:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lancelot！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.36,1:12:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oi，mate！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.76,1:12:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，buddy，that's not an exit！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.48,1:12:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，come on up.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.08,1:12:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yep。Come on up！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.68,1:12:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，monkeys。Terrific.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.88,1:12:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love the costumes.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.24,1:12:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry。I just gotta say，you're the whole package，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.52,1:12:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.60,1:12:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He recognized you。- Yeah，that was awesome.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.68,1:12:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Give me the Tablet！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.40,1:12:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay back！Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.60,1:12:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stand back！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.00,1:12:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.84,1:12:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.40,1:12:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your，uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.76,1:12:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your nose，it's…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.92,1:12:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about my nose？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.44,1:12:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your nose is dripping.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.88,1:12:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- It's melting.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.08,1:12:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,From the fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.28,1:12:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.88,1:12:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,How bad is it？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.04,1:12:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is not great.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.60,1:12:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I'm Lancelot！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.96,1:12:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,There never was a Lancelot！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.12,1:12:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lancelot is a legend.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.40,1:12:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not real.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.12,1:13:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't understand！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.28,1:13:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know it's a lot to take in，
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.26,1:13:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,but please，just give me the Tablet.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.64,1:13:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，and then what？Back to the museum？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.96,1:13:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stand there as little children ogle and point？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.40,1:13:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,And learn.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.80,1:13:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,And get inspired to do great things.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.24,1:13:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,There are far less noble fates，my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.32,1:13:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not for me，there aren't！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.96,1:13:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,If there is no Camelot.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.92,1:13:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,There is no Guinevere and no Lancelot，
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.48,1:13:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,then I'm nothing。I'm just a sad lump of misshapen wax.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.80,1:13:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop looking at my nose！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.40,1:13:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I wasn't looking at it。- You were，I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.16,1:13:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were like this。「Hmm，hmm.」 Staring.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.00,1:13:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I wasn't like that。- You were！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.24,1:13:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't look at it！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.32,1:13:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,It really is hard not to look at.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.44,1:13:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.16,1:13:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I didn't。- I saw you！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.32,1:13:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I'm looking at your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.48,1:13:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Monkey，stop it！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.08,1:13:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Could you give me the Tablet，please？Give me the Tablet.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.96,1:13:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you give me the Tablet，I promise I won't…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.24,1:13:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do not look at my nose！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.48,1:13:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Give me the Tablet。- Look away.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.86,1:13:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Give me the Tablet。- How hard could it be
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.66,1:13:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,not to look at my nose？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.68,1:13:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna look at your nose.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.28,1:13:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm looking… I can't help it！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.52,1:13:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look to the heavens！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.36,1:13:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.84,1:13:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yet，he's still handsome.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.52,1:14:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,No one shall look at，or mention，
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.02,1:14:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,my nose from this moment forward！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.76,1:14:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，I forgot what we were talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.20,1:14:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lawrence.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.04,1:14:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Teddy！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.64,1:14:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.88,1:14:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've run out of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.20,1:14:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen to me。You got to straighten the pieces.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.72,1:14:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Straighten the pieces right now or they're all gonna die！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.88,1:14:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,You too！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.96,1:14:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,A world without Camelot is not a world worth living in.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.20,1:14:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.16,1:14:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dexter，what is it？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.68,1:14:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,You all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.72,1:14:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，hey，man，you okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.72,1:14:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.04,1:14:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，you want to slap me？Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.92,1:14:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go ahead，slap me in the face.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.88,1:15:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dex？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.88,1:15:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dexter？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.32,1:15:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dexter？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.96,1:15:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！No，no。No.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.92,1:15:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dexter？No，no。Come on，man！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.44,1:15:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.68,1:15:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll take that hand now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.88,1:15:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I understand now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.04,1:15:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,The monkey was the quest.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.12,1:15:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was never about the Tablet.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.12,1:15:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was about them.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.20,1:15:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.60,1:15:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is I who have been the fool.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.32,1:16:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're back，baby！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.68,1:16:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lawrence！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.92,1:16:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome back，buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.32,1:16:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well done，Larry！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.60,1:16:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,There he is。That's our guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.44,1:16:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come here！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.36,1:16:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here's your Tablet.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.00,1:16:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,It feels good，doesn't it，Jedediah？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.32,1:16:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boy，you said it！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.20,1:16:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.64,1:17:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do I look？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.04,1:17:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,You look like Lancelot.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.20,1:17:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well done，my child.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.88,1:17:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.68,1:17:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,for bringing my son home safely.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.68,1:17:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a strange thing…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.20,1:17:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,seeing your boy become a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.48,1:17:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,There were lions chasing us.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.48,1:17:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，it's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.72,1:17:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,One day，they're riding a dinosaur through Central Park，
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.40,1:17:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,and then the next day they're DJ-ing in lbiza.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.24,1:17:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've served my family well.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.72,1:17:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,We shall build a great tomb and bury you with many riches.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.04,1:18:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I，personally，will see to it that your organs are removed
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.56,1:18:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,and placed in separate jewel-encrusted jars.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.08,1:18:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.60,1:18:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then we're agreed.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.28,1:18:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lawrence，
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.60,1:18:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,may I have a word？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.24,1:18:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,The others and I have been talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.60,1:18:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ahkmenrah's place is here with his family.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.60,1:18:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,He must remain here.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.08,1:18:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,And the Tablet should stay here as well，son.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.56,1:18:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is where it belongs，Gigantor.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.88,1:18:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，but it…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.92,1:18:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,That means you guys would have to stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.36,1:18:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,We belong in New York.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.24,1:18:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，but if you…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.72,1:18:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you guys go，then you，
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.44,1:18:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,you won't be alive after tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.60,1:18:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're museum exhibits，Laredo.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.56,1:18:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's what we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.56,1:18:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Folks come to look at us，
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.44,1:18:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,maybe learn a little something.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.88,1:18:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's alive，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.80,1:18:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I'm…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.48,1:19:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to take care of you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.24,1:19:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you have.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.48,1:19:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay，Lawrence.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.84,1:19:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.96,1:19:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.76,1:19:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go，son.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.16,1:19:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you for giving me back my family，Larry.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.96,1:19:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guardian of Brooklyn.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.16,1:19:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，if we leave right now，
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.36,1:19:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,we can still catch a flight，
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.52,1:19:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,get home with everyone still awake
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.76,1:19:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,before the sun comes up.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.16,1:19:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.04,1:19:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.88,1:19:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all right，Larry.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.20,1:19:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've reached something of an understanding.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.20,1:19:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Really？- Trixey，sit.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.88,1:19:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow！That's really good.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.48,1:19:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good job，Lance.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.00,1:19:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.40,1:20:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Trixey，behave.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.00,1:20:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.72,1:20:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Steady.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.04,1:20:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,He never even listens to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.48,1:20:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.92,1:20:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just feel like you really listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.28,1:20:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's like our hearts are
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.78,1:20:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,in perfect sync with each other right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.20,1:20:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Um… Do you feel what…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.56,1:20:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry to interrupt whatever… is happening.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.80,1:20:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，Laaa，the guys are waiting outside。We gotta go。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.92,1:20:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？No.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.60,1:20:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！Laaa，stay！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.16,1:20:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know this sounds crazy，
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.08,1:20:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,but you and I could make a life together here in England.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.97,1:20:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Laaa.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.92,1:20:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow。Okay。Um…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.20,1:21:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will never forget you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.84,1:21:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are the most rugged man that I have ever，ever met.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.12,1:21:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep the scrunchies.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.84,1:21:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，Laaa。We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.84,1:21:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.48,1:21:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I won't say anything if you won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.64,1:21:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，I know you hate this job and everything，
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.83,1:21:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,but tomorrow night，
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.80,1:21:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,best job ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.68,1:22:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure is quiet around here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.04,1:22:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Without the Tablet，it's just like any other museum.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.40,1:22:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what I'm gonna remember most about you？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.96,1:22:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.92,1:22:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,How big you guys are.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.24,1:22:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.88,1:22:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.72,1:22:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.72,1:22:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,My
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.76,1:22:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.88,1:23:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,You speak English？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.92,1:23:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，listen。Um…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.32,1:23:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Up there on the roof，when…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.16,1:23:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,When you almost…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.40,1:23:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.12,1:23:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just want you to know…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.36,1:23:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I really changed my perspective on everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.64,1:23:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know we have a weird…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.92,1:23:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have this dynamic，we have this tension.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.60,1:23:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back and forth.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.52,1:23:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，games，right？You know？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.84,1:23:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roles that we put ourselves into，
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.44,1:23:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,but why does it have to be that way？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.12,1:23:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,I feel like there's always been a mutual
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.76,1:23:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,sort of respect for each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.36,1:23:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anyway，
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.12,1:24:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll miss you，you know？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.56,1:24:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.80,1:24:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go ahead。One last slap.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.56,1:24:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I felt that was there for a long time，too.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.92,1:24:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.76,1:25:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who would have ever thought？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.68,1:25:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm wax，she's polyurethane.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.92,1:25:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,But somehow，it worked.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.88,1:25:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess this is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.68,1:25:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.04,1:25:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I know young Nick will do great things.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.56,1:25:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，he's，uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.44,1:25:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,ready to take on the world all by himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.28,1:25:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then you've done your job.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.04,1:25:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've done your job.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.36,1:25:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's time for your next adventure.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.36,1:25:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have no idea what I'm gonna do tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.88,1:25:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,How exciting.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.56,1:25:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bye，Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.44,1:25:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Farewell，Lawrence.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.60,1:26:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got you！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.84,1:26:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Smile，my boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.28,1:26:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.28,1:26:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey。- Hey。You good？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.48,1:26:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah，I am。- Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.52,1:26:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，lbiza？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.76,1:26:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Uh。The whole DJ thing，Dad，
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.36,1:26:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know if that's the thing for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.60,1:26:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just know that it's the next thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.80,1:26:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,After that，maybe college.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.72,1:26:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm figuring it all out，you know？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.80,1:26:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sounds like a plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.88,1:27:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I should get back to Mom's，or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.64,1:27:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.52,1:27:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.32,1:27:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love you，too.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.40,1:27:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.16,1:27:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.64,1:27:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.04,1:28:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three years，no Larry Daley.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.68,1:28:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was the one that took the fall for me，got me my job back.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.36,1:28:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I heard he went back to school，
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.20,1:28:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,got his degree，became a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.36,1:28:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm very glad.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.52,1:28:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，when he heard about this traveling exhibition.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.64,1:28:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry insisted that I deliver this to you personally.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.88,1:28:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah！The infamous，supposedly magic，glowing Tablet.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.12,1:28:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry Daley and his fanciful tales.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.56,1:28:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry said you could be trusted.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.04,1:28:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you mean？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.80,1:28:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,With the top secret knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.72,1:28:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.16,1:28:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm winking。- You're blinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.12,1:28:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I wink with both eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.12,1:28:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's blinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.28,1:28:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter，because right now，
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.48,1:28:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,you better get ready！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.08,1:28:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,For what？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.40,1:28:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,For this.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.16,1:29:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,It does glow.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.28,1:29:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.24,1:29:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.56,1:30:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.24,1:30:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have fun-fun，Dum Dum.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.96,1:30:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.20,1:30:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.08,1:30:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.44,1:30:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not going anywhere！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.49,0:00:58.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（埃及 1938年）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.53,0:01:02.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（寻找阿卡曼拉法老之墓探险队）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.64,0:01:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 我们危险了 风暴要来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.92,0:01:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手下都很惊慌 我们必须离开
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.84,0:01:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那座坟墓就在附近 我能感觉到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托罗伯特 都两个月了还毫无所获
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.24,0:01:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿奇 我不会半途而废的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.52,0:01:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.84,0:01:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这风是怎么回事 波普
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.84,0:01:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,C.J 去车里等我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.24,0:01:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想在车里无所事事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.52,0:01:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你快去 把窗户关上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.40,0:01:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伯特
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.48,0:01:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷德里克斯先生 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.60,0:02:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.48,0:02:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,C.J吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.92,0:02:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.12,0:02:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.28,0:02:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.24,0:02:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找了阿卡曼拉法老之墓20年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.96,0:02:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.12,0:02:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你直接掉进了墓穴里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:02:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃米尔 开始装车
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.08,0:03:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷德里克斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.44,0:03:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.60,0:03:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,风暴将至
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.36,0:03:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你最好动作快点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.76,0:03:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 大家都动起来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.68,0:03:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.00,0:03:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 我们必须立刻离开
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.32,0:03:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有任何人打扰法老之墓的安宁
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.04,0:03:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,末日将至
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.80,0:03:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,末日将至
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.48,0:03:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们装车
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.64,0:04:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们在犯一个可怕的错误
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.04,0:04:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是犯错 这叫创造历史
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.88,0:04:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.20,0:04:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,C.J 快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.72,0:04:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,末日将至
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.91,0:04:33.87,Title,0,0,0,0,,《博物馆奇妙夜3：墓葬秘密》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.72,0:04:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎各位莅临自然历史博物馆
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.04,0:04:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,参加刚修缮完毕的海登天文馆
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.20,0:04:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,盛大的重开仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.12,0:04:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约名流齐聚一堂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这注定难忘的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.40,0:04:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在让人眼花缭乱的特效
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.36,0:04:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,和技术魔法中
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.54,0:04:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来到这里 欣赏博物馆
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.08,0:04:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,欣赏著名的奇妙夜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.96,0:04:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚不会闷闷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.12,0:04:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家欢迎笨笨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.80,0:04:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗 萨卡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.20,0:04:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷克斯打蜡抛光完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.96,0:05:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪在整理他的小胡子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.04,0:05:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还给原始人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.17,0:05:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,复习了博物馆的消防安全规程
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.40,0:05:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 你们最近见过他们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,博物馆新添了一个原始人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.40,0:05:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.56,0:05:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,要让百夫长把动作舒展开 好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.88,0:05:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在带妆彩排上很卖力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.24,0:05:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但确实还不太习惯这种舞步
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.40,0:05:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 各位 听着
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.08,0:05:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让大家紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.40,0:05:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但市长和州长都将观看演出
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.04,0:05:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我不是百分之百确定
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.08,0:05:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想里吉斯·菲尔宾也会来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.28,0:05:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,里吉·菲波
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.00,0:05:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 里吉·菲波
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷克斯 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.64,0:05:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心尾巴 表演会有明火
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.32,0:05:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,德克斯特
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.80,0:05:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 哥们儿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.16,0:05:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,都准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.44,0:05:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去不错 领结很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.76,0:05:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点齐本德尔风
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,防滑粉也涂了 准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 大家放松点 尽情享受吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.68,0:05:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好过来看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.12,0:05:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前发生过这种情况吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.60,0:05:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没有过
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.68,0:05:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没见过它被腐蚀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.68,0:05:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,它以前从来都是一个样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.28,0:06:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说它怎么了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.28,0:06:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.96,0:06:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.12,0:06:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲比我更了解金碑的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.88,0:06:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜他发过誓 永远不透露这个秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.80,0:06:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且也真的只字未提
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.96,0:06:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.56,0:06:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.84,0:06:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.96,0:06:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚表演不要紧张 好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.20,0:06:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有15分钟就要上台了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.20,0:06:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明天再考虑这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.12,0:06:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.52,0:06:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.32,0:06:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的妈呀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.16,0:06:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.32,0:06:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们想把光抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.24,0:06:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,做不到的 小猫咪 光是抓不住的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.04,0:06:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,光和人类的幸福一样可望而不可及
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.64,0:06:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要评论
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,召唤装备
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.32,0:06:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,上装备
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.52,0:06:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算发什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.84,0:06:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.88,0:07:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.16,0:07:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.52,0:07:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑翻了 对 我也这么缩写
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.60,0:07:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在把这个萌猫视频
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.36,0:07:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我的御评一起发到脸书去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.20,0:07:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,也代杰迪戴亚向脸书群众
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.74,0:07:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,带去德克萨斯式喝彩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.68,0:07:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我也特爱这视频
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.96,0:07:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,发个笑脸就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.24,0:07:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要带眨眼的那个笑脸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.36,0:07:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,眨眼笑脸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.76,0:07:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,几位 你们干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.92,0:07:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是看个萌猫视频
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.52,0:07:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有5分钟你们就要上台了 别分心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.56,0:07:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说不该在这儿浪费时间的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.24,0:07:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还发了德克萨斯式喝彩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.20,0:07:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪 准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.68,0:07:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 劳伦斯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.76,0:07:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 - 古巴圣胡安山之战时
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是很冷静的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在 心里小鹿乱撞 忐忑异常
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.56,0:07:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会很棒的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.68,0:07:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳伦斯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.76,0:07:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最近看到过穴居人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.28,0:07:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 怎么大家都这么关注
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.04,0:07:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会想去看看的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.72,0:08:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.92,0:08:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.68,0:08:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.40,0:08:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 不必下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用客气 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗 我是拉里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.60,0:08:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是拉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是拉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.44,0:08:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 拉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.32,0:08:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入我们 然后
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.44,0:08:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们长的很像
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.92,0:08:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们非常相似 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.92,0:08:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这肯定是谁开的玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.28,0:08:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克菲博士把你做成了我的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.76,0:08:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.96,0:08:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.32,0:08:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸比 - 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.28,0:08:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸比
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.44,0:08:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是你爸比
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.12,0:08:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸比
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.28,0:08:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 停下 - 爸比
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.12,0:08:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸比 - 爸比
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.80,0:09:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是他的 不是你爸比
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.12,0:09:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨笨又有宝宝啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.00,0:09:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他没有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.84,0:09:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸比
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸比
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,为新任女议长干杯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.88,0:09:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,请大家举杯 干杯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.04,0:09:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,音乐响起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.96,0:09:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪倒计时开始 三 二
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.32,0:09:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,1869年 我还是个11岁的男孩时
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.68,0:09:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,博物馆就是这伟大城市中一颗耀眼明珠
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.32,0:09:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我们将让它的光芒传播到更远的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.24,0:09:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,到达太阳
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,月亮 和渺渺星辰
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.16,0:09:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,开天辟地 混沌初开之时
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们就在仰望天空
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.44,0:09:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,命名着目之所及
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.08,0:09:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是星座的由来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.08,0:09:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想大家也许愿意见见这些星座
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.60,0:09:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,星座特效开启
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.52,0:10:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄里翁 猎户星座
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.72,0:10:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.92,0:10:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是计划好的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.56,0:10:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早知道会这样的 没事没事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.64,0:10:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,很棒 进展顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.76,0:10:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下丝绸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.56,0:10:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,猴子出场
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.48,0:10:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.32,0:11:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.52,0:11:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我应该做的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.20,0:11:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢您的光临
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.64,0:11:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢您对这个优秀机构的鼎力支持
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.44,0:11:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,新近重开的天文馆就像一架望远镜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.44,0:11:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,共赴战场 我亲爱的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.28,0:11:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.36,0:11:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.80,0:11:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,骑兵们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.28,0:11:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事 稍安勿躁 - 这也是表演吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.68,0:11:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉各位 出了点技术问题
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.20,0:11:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.40,0:12:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,按照剧本走 按照剧本走
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.24,0:12:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是我 - 我不认识你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.16,0:12:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我是怎么了 但感觉不错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.92,0:12:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,放倒他们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.16,0:12:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.20,0:12:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄里翁 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.40,0:13:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.12,0:13:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 刚才是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.08,0:13:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 你们怎么想的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.72,0:13:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉 我一个人就行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.24,0:13:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去那边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.88,0:13:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 去那边
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.16,0:13:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.32,0:13:40.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（点击器）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.56,0:13:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,匈奴王
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.24,0:13:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对那只海豚做了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.16,0:13:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是只海豚哎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.28,0:13:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球上最热爱和平的生物之一
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.16,0:13:50.76,Title,0,0,0,0,,你却像《海豚湾》中日本人一样残杀它们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.24,0:13:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到里吉斯·菲尔宾脸上表情没
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.20,0:13:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说里吉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.24,0:13:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 里吉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.76,0:13:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪 你为什么拿枪瞄着我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.16,0:14:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉劳伦斯 我不知道我怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.52,0:14:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得那些事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.24,0:14:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点也不记得
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.00,0:14:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉 快关掉 那是个电击器
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.44,0:14:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,快放下 很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.28,0:14:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉 那是电击 不是耳机
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.92,0:14:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 你这是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 德克斯特
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.84,0:14:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.64,0:14:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是一直这么幼稚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.76,0:14:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就去给你买点纸尿裤
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.00,0:14:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,又想穿纸尿裤了是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.68,0:14:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,马儿 别激动
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.60,0:14:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看不到吗 他很愧疚了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.28,0:14:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我们都很愧疚的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.92,0:14:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道大家这是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.56,0:14:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但今晚真的很奇怪 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.12,0:14:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.68,0:14:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们像被魔咒控制了一样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.12,0:14:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们都不像平常的自己了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.40,0:14:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 拉里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.40,0:14:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克菲博士
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.92,0:14:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.32,0:14:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,还行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.60,0:14:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好很好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.72,0:15:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道躲在垃圾桶里担心着小命不保
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.88,0:15:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为霸王龙雷克斯在把装着你的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.41,0:15:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,垃圾桶当球踢时的那种声音吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.24,0:15:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有听过这种声音
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有听过啊 稍等
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.48,0:15:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这种声音 害的我觉也睡不好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.04,0:15:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 我真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.48,0:15:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 我真的不知道今晚到底
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.92,0:15:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道今晚怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.92,0:15:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只负责特效管理
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.92,0:15:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的错 特效是你负责的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.88,0:15:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我知道 - 真是笑话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.00,0:15:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,特效 还不如说是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.00,0:15:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,特烂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.88,0:15:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证 我会弄清楚这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.96,0:15:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者说他们就是 特次品
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.80,0:15:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 麦克菲博士 我得挂了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.20,0:15:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼基 尼基
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.24,0:15:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跳了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.64,0:15:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 你干什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.84,0:15:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话该我问你才对
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.00,0:16:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,都凌晨三点了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.68,0:16:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 聚会结束
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.32,0:16:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.52,0:16:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我叫Sophie - Sophie
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.88,0:16:07.88,Title,0,0,0,0,,演《再见，伯蒂》那个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.00,0:16:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 演得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.44,0:16:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.60,0:16:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么明晚见
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可能不行 - 可能行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.04,0:16:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.04,0:16:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.48,0:16:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你摊上事儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.64,0:16:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.28,0:16:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你会提前回家
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.16,0:16:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 这能看出来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.48,0:16:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.16,0:16:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能这样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.96,0:16:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在妈妈那儿住的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.12,0:16:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你每晚都扔我一个人在家
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.44,0:16:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你现在还不能这么放肆
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.32,0:16:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有期末考试
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.09,0:16:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约大学的申请期限还有多久 两周吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.08,0:16:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会去纽约大学
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.60,0:16:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不能确认 - 不 我确认
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.04,0:16:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能确认
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.32,0:16:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确认 非常确定
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.32,0:16:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我根本没想申请
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.20,0:16:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.40,0:16:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得那个地方现在并不适合我 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.92,0:16:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 没事儿 也行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.10,0:16:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要自由飞翔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.56,0:16:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,去别的城市 到其他地方念书
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.84,0:16:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 我完全赞成
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.45,0:16:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需要事先告诉我就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.24,0:16:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.40,0:17:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有候选名单吗 - 名单很短
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.40,0:17:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我喜欢 目标明确
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.60,0:17:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能给的名单很短 老爸 因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.72,0:17:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,名单上什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.56,0:17:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也没…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.80,0:17:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白 什么叫没有名单
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.92,0:17:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.80,0:17:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想休学一年
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.20,0:17:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就想照你刚才说的做
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.12,0:17:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想自由飞翔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.84,0:17:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想自由飞翔 这很好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.24,0:17:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你不能光张开翅膀哪儿也不去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.80,0:17:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 计划有变 - 不 没变
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.84,0:17:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没变 计划没变
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.40,0:17:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们曾经有过计划 但它变了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.72,0:17:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一开始可能会不知所措 - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.20,0:17:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能改变计划
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.48,0:17:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非征得计划投资人的同意
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.52,0:17:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说 你妈妈和我 明白了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.56,0:17:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 我们可以坐这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.58,0:17:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直谈有关计划的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.40,0:17:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在 还是收工吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.96,0:17:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也别收拾屋子了 好不
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.56,0:17:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天再谈吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.80,0:17:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候我们重整旗鼓
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.16,0:17:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新看待问题
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.64,0:17:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会把它搞定的 老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.72,0:17:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴利传奇 今晚别谈了 等明天的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.44,0:17:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 戴利传奇
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.60,0:17:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 可以闭嘴了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.64,0:17:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.80,0:17:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿收拾 我去睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.24,0:17:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明天再谈这事儿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.72,0:18:10.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（自然历史博物馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.76,0:18:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶 走你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.16,0:18:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,走你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.32,0:18:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这么任性
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.88,0:18:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.40,0:18:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是拉里·戴利 夜场演出负责人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.52,0:18:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你 你是那个保安
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.52,0:18:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 也是夜场演出负责人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.60,0:18:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在做一些调查
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.04,0:18:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,想看看你是否能帮我一把
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.36,0:18:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 夜间保安搞研究
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.52,0:18:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳打西边出来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.32,0:18:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.60,0:18:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想找关于
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.08,0:18:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿卡曼拉金碑的一切资料
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.96,0:18:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,中心通道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.16,0:18:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太好了 - 走到中间 左手边
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.24,0:18:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,走你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.48,0:19:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.16,0:19:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么对这个金碑这么感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.96,0:19:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 只是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.72,0:19:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是个爱好 个人兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.44,0:19:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望我能跟他们谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.96,0:19:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谈不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.56,0:19:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.64,0:19:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们死了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.08,0:19:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.20,0:19:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是看那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.56,0:19:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是个孩子 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.88,0:19:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会是认识他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.00,0:19:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,C.J·弗雷德里克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.16,0:19:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还在这里工作过呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.76,0:19:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这里工作过
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.53,0:19:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 在他长大之后
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.80,0:19:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是吧 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.04,0:19:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个夜间保安
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.00,0:19:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.36,0:19:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 C.J
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.12,0:19:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,C.J·弗雷德里克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.28,0:19:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是塞西尔·弗雷德里克斯吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.80,0:19:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,史上最性感的夜间保安
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.64,0:19:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括现任
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.64,0:19:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 他那舞姿真是无人能及
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.48,0:20:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.68,0:20:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 塞西尔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.16,0:20:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 好久不见
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.84,0:20:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来过的不错
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.44,0:20:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还风华正茂呢 伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.52,0:20:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这儿做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.88,0:20:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想跟你谈谈有关金碑的事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.52,0:20:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这矬子干嘛来的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.64,0:20:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 格斯 你气色不错
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.56,0:20:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷金纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.12,0:20:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是又来陷害我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.28,0:20:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们去受牢狱之苦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.00,0:20:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没陷害你们 你们确实偷东西了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.12,0:20:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还是我把你们弄出监狱的 所以
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.08,0:20:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这儿过的非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.24,0:20:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去的事就过去了 我们都看开了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.48,0:20:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不觉得这家伙看开了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.80,0:20:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好听他说话 猴脸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.64,0:20:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经把金碑抛之脑后了 拉里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.20,0:20:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是陈年往事了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.48,0:20:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们对那个古老的金碑一无所知
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.44,0:21:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是在那儿工作
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.88,0:21:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,它出了点事儿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.28,0:21:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说了 我没法帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.20,0:21:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这孩子能帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.60,0:21:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最好私聊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.44,0:21:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于一个12岁的小男孩来说
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.84,0:21:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,远征寻宝是一件非常美妙的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.44,0:21:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾尽力将它忘怀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.52,0:21:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那金碑很不一般
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.48,0:21:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,它变绿了 像是被腐蚀了一样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.96,0:21:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪和德克斯特开始变得不对劲儿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.60,0:21:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有杰德和奥克塔维厄斯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.80,0:21:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都表现得很古怪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.56,0:21:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是绿锈会影响他们一样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.92,0:21:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,末日将至
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.04,0:21:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.80,0:21:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,当地人警告过我们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.64,0:21:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,求我们不要打扰墓穴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.44,0:21:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时还以为是世界末日的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.72,0:21:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是也许它的意思是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.32,0:22:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔法的终结
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.96,0:22:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当时真该听他们的话
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.80,0:22:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,该听他们的话啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.48,0:22:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们却把阿卡和金碑运到了纽约
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.76,0:22:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他的父母送去了英格兰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.76,0:22:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.16,0:22:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿卡曼拉的父母在英格兰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.08,0:22:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那次是合作探险
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.08,0:22:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些文物留在了埃及
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.52,0:22:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的被纽约和大英博物馆分摊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.80,0:22:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿卡说他父亲知道金碑的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.68,0:22:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我应该去找他谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.56,0:22:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.24,0:22:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们尊贵的女主席要求我退位让贤
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.48,0:22:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说 既然夜场演出是我的主意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.92,0:22:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就一人做事一人当
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.64,0:22:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能解决问题 - 怎么解决
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.00,0:22:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得让我把金碑和阿卡曼拉一起带到伦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.96,0:22:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我要处理一下这个信息
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.48,0:22:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,输入数据分析
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.12,0:22:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚跟你说完 我被解雇了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.72,0:22:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你开口的第一句
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.20,0:22:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,却是问我能不能让你带着珍贵的文物
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.28,0:22:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你一起去度假
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.64,0:23:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 求你了 - 不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.04,0:23:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是想请你跟我站在统一战线上
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.80,0:23:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 额 - 求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.96,0:23:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到 兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.04,0:23:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.68,0:23:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要打劫吗 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.92,0:23:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 就是做点心理准备
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.52,0:23:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要你听我说 - 哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.60,0:23:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吗 - 成
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.68,0:23:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想知道真相是吧 - 继续说
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.48,0:23:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,真相就是 那个金碑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.32,0:23:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个金碑有魔力
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.60,0:23:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上那些展品真的会有生命
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.64,0:23:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是特技效果
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.45,0:23:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那不是特技效果 - 当然是特技效果
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.80,0:23:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怎么会是特技效果呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.92,0:23:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怎么就不是特技效果呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.08,0:23:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为那不是 - 因为那是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.68,0:23:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我告诉你 这是真事儿 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.12,0:23:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳落山之后
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.16,0:23:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,金碑就会开始发光
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.64,0:23:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,博物馆里的一切事物都有了生命
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.96,0:23:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 这是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.80,0:23:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,金碑开始发光
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.36,0:23:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在可知道了 你就是个精神病
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.36,0:23:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 莱斯利
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.64,0:23:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 我不会伤害你的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.80,0:23:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 只是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.36,0:23:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.25,0:24:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人比我们更关心这个地方了 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.20,0:24:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.44,0:24:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.64,0:24:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方的一切奇妙之处都将不复存在
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.60,0:24:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且可能永远不会复原了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.60,0:24:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是在强迫你理解
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.88,0:24:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是希望你能信任我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.36,0:24:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.96,0:24:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这儿已经不归我管了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.16,0:24:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,大英博物馆可不知道这个
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.52,0:24:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,木乃伊和金碑一起
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.80,0:24:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,机密保护工作
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.24,0:24:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我应允的 当然
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.04,0:24:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是博物馆的主管 而且现在仍是
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.16,0:24:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,成 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.40,0:24:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,妥了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.60,0:25:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我自己在纽约待着就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.08,0:25:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵 不 那不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.56,0:25:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 景色很美 是吧 - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.16,0:25:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰晤士河
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.60,0:25:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是很酷吗 孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.90,0:25:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱俩一起在英国
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.64,0:25:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说话啊 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.84,0:25:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在想休学那件事
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.88,0:25:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.32,0:25:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.40,0:25:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.20,0:25:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么想法吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.40,0:25:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,额 哇哦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.36,0:25:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想去伊比萨当DJ
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.00,0:25:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,去伊比萨
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.16,0:25:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊比萨是西班牙海岸的一个小岛
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.84,0:25:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会说西班牙语吗 - 不会
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.76,0:25:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这恰好是其美妙之处 关乎音乐
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.88,0:25:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不受语言限制的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.08,0:25:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 但是你会受语言限制
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.92,0:25:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你靠打节拍说话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.47,0:25:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么这么反感
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.36,0:25:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才还说这是一个很棒的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.00,0:25:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没反感
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.20,0:25:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想了解一下计划的怎么样的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.04,0:26:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就没上大学
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.92,0:26:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,停 现在成了压根儿不上大学了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.68,0:26:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许吧 我不知道 - 尼基
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.20,0:26:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼基 这可不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.76,0:26:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 你没上大学 现在混得也不错
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.72,0:26:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我四处碰壁的奋斗了二十年
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.00,0:26:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,才混个勉勉强强
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.16,0:26:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便吧 老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.88,0:26:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心我 我挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.08,0:26:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不可能不担心你
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.72,0:26:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是你爸爸 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.36,0:26:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳落山了 我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.88,0:26:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.52,0:26:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 咱们的计划是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.24,0:26:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,金碑把阿卡曼拉复活之后
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.77,0:26:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会偷偷把我们弄进去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.88,0:26:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在趴下 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.04,0:26:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下就行 快 冒险的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.52,0:26:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 欢迎来到大英博物馆
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.52,0:26:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫蒂莉
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.68,0:26:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.00,0:27:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉里·戴利 来自纽约自然历史博物馆
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.28,0:27:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 哦 - 我这儿有一份货物
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.80,0:27:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是送到你们文物保护部门的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.76,0:27:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.60,0:27:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说他们允许你出差
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.16,0:27:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次的情况比较特殊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.44,0:27:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也允许我出差 你猜去哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.80,0:27:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不知道 - 家 这儿 家
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.72,0:27:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,再回这儿来
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.08,0:27:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,给马桶喂饭
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.92,0:27:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,最多五分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.72,0:27:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,在美国当保安一定很过瘾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.96,0:27:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 额 - 佩枪 带消音器
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.72,0:27:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,背着忍者刀
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.88,0:27:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.88,0:27:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是一点都不贴边儿
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.88,0:27:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我只有这个
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.92,0:27:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 - 锤子 这是为…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.96,0:27:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,引用他们的原话
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.27,0:27:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,修修补补 美容美化
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.40,0:27:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就给这小破屋子
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.68,0:27:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就只是敲敲打打吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.64,0:27:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒挺朗朗上口的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.32,0:27:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点儿意思也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.76,0:27:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们居然还在聊天
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.44,0:27:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多好呀 对吧 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.24,0:27:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是我到这里三年来
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.08,0:27:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,最长的对话
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.88,0:28:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有同感
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.84,0:28:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能进去卸货吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.16,0:28:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然啦 - 棒
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.00,0:28:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要先确认一下
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.80,0:28:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实没这个必要
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.16,0:28:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚给你的文件上边已经确认过了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.12,0:28:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 确认中
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.96,0:28:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.52,0:28:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我是麦克菲博士
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.40,0:28:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 这里是大英博物馆
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.24,0:28:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想确认一下艺术保护部是否要送来藏品
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.44,0:28:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我签了文件
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.24,0:28:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没别的事我挂了 我还要照看博物馆呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.32,0:28:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小孩 别用脏手碰我的明代花瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.64,0:28:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了吗 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.72,0:28:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.92,0:28:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行了吗 - 好吧 你可以进去
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.00,0:28:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就进吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.64,0:28:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 - 确认哒
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.32,0:28:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 好呢 我开门啦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.88,0:28:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.96,0:28:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我男朋友吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.84,0:28:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不喜欢我的发型
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.72,0:28:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,说看上去像一坨金色的便便团在我肩上
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.52,0:28:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我超喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.28,0:28:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 拉里
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.24,0:29:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是很懂
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.44,0:29:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们这样 肯定是犯法的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.24,0:29:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 英美用的是不同的法律体系
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.24,0:29:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.48,0:29:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.60,0:29:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.76,0:29:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.32,0:29:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉里 其他人觉得我们可能会需要帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.56,0:29:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.00,0:30:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳伦斯 我可不能干等着
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.88,0:30:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的生命岌岌可危
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.60,0:30:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 泰迪 好样的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.64,0:30:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,危机中最需要的人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.96,0:30:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,匈奴王
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.44,0:30:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 力气大
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.44,0:30:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉里
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.52,0:30:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这箱子怎么可能这么大
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.24,0:30:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.40,0:30:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没我们你肯定会迷路啊 铁人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.48,0:30:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.12,0:30:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,猴子 好吧 基本上就是大家都来了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.44,0:30:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.52,0:30:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去 不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.20,0:30:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来有毛线用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.12,0:30:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的特别想来
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.76,0:30:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.96,0:30:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真正的儿子 尼基
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.80,0:30:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尼基 这是拉 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.80,0:30:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总盯着我
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.60,0:30:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.56,0:30:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳伦斯
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.72,0:30:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,进攻计划是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.96,0:30:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要到埃及区找到阿卡的父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.52,0:30:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望他能修好金碑
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.64,0:31:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.72,0:31:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉 那些不能吃 不是吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.00,0:31:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.40,0:31:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有事要你干
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.24,0:31:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.88,0:31:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.04,0:31:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你在这里看着这扇门 好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.04,0:31:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保没人进出 行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.56,0:31:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你可以当个保安 像我一样
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.44,0:31:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.32,0:31:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.84,0:31:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.52,0:31:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手放门上
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.72,0:31:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 留下 - 留下
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.92,0:31:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 对了 你待在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.80,0:31:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.16,0:31:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下 对
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.80,0:31:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 留下
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.84,0:31:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 留下 - 留下
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.36,0:31:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看前面 对 留下
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.04,0:31:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 对 留下
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.88,0:31:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 留下
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.36,0:31:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.64,0:31:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不许动
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.28,0:31:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.32,0:31:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许 对了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.80,0:31:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 听着 伙计们
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.44,0:31:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方是第一次醒过来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.08,0:32:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道会发生什么
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.15,0:32:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们不能走散 知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.88,0:32:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道挺恐怖的 大块头
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.28,0:32:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟紧点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.96,0:32:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是些什么玩意儿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.08,0:32:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是只有我觉得很诡异 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.16,0:32:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是吓坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.96,0:32:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们第一次醒过来也用了很久才适应
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.92,0:32:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我们要去埃及
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.72,0:32:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 这边
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.16,0:33:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.64,0:33:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到什么
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.64,0:33:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.96,0:33:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里面哦 有需要就叫我们
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.84,0:33:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我们害怕 是这里边舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.28,0:33:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳伦斯
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.52,0:33:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们有点儿小麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.00,0:33:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道怎么搞定这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.12,0:33:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,介意借给我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.32,0:33:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.04,0:33:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 你要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.48,0:33:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我是怎么驯服你哥们儿雷克斯的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.00,0:33:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.28,0:33:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是坏孩子 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.92,0:33:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说你肯定很乖
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.88,0:33:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是只乖狗狗 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.60,0:33:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想玩游戏的乖狗狗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.36,0:33:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,想玩吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.20,0:33:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,想玩接骨头游戏吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.36,0:33:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,想吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.56,0:33:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,想和这根骨头玩玩吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.24,0:33:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.32,0:33:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 去叼回来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.16,0:33:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,接住
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.84,0:34:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 劳伦斯 - 怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.64,0:34:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能提个建议吗 - 什么建议
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.12,0:34:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃跑
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.72,0:34:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,快关门 关门
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.04,0:34:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我想我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.80,0:34:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 大家全都退后
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.72,0:34:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你既然不吃敬酒
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.88,0:34:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就吃罚酒吧 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.60,0:35:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好险啊 - 需要帮助吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.44,0:35:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啥 - 让开
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.36,0:35:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,匈奴王 你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.88,0:35:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可能要… - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.76,0:35:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.16,0:35:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.28,0:35:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 真是非常酷
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.96,0:35:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰斯洛特爵士 乐意为您效劳
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.24,0:35:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 太酷炫了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.12,0:36:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,西奥多·罗斯福
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.32,0:36:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,美利坚合众国总统
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.48,0:36:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本不知道那是个啥
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.36,0:36:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是拉里 这是我儿子尼克
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.96,0:36:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有一张贵族的脸 尼克
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.60,0:36:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 谢谢你帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.84,0:36:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.68,0:36:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很像我在卡米洛特认识的一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.20,0:36:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.44,0:36:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,圆桌骑士之一吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.56,0:36:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 埃里克
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.80,0:36:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃里克
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.76,0:36:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的小丑
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.12,0:36:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我见过的最好玩的小丑
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.48,0:36:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直太棒 他都不用特意搞笑
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.60,0:36:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需要走进来 你就能笑翻
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.92,0:36:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.80,0:36:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你和他一样 那种天赋 - 真神奇
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.76,0:36:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你也可以当小丑 - 这可不一定
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.76,0:36:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.08,0:36:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先给你弄个帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.57,0:36:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,边上吊着很多小铃铛的那种
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.44,0:36:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,小铃铛
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.88,0:36:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,「小铃铛」
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.16,0:36:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说得没错吧 天赋
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.08,0:36:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一点儿都不刻意
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.36,0:36:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么一张木头脸
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.88,0:36:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一点点点…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.44,0:36:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么特别表情 就那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.00,0:36:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.16,0:37:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,和埃里克一模一样
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.72,0:37:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来他人不错啊 我们得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.16,0:37:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡米洛特啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.36,0:37:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.48,0:37:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天我会回到那雄伟的城堡里
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.00,0:37:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到亚瑟王
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.92,0:37:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,和格温娜维尔王后身边
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.44,0:37:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,迷人的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.60,0:37:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,美丽的格温娜维尔
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.60,0:37:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我发誓完成使命之前绝不回去
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.56,0:37:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须找到圣杯
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.80,0:37:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.20,0:37:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次感谢你帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.52,0:37:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去埃及了 回见
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.20,0:37:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我带你们去 - 不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.92,0:37:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下 小铃铛
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.28,0:37:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有奇怪的魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.16,0:37:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有危险的野兽在活动
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.16,0:37:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一名真正的骑士
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.20,0:37:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须保护照顾那些有难的人们
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.84,0:37:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.64,0:37:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来是甩不掉他了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.72,0:37:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉里
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.16,0:37:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰德和奥克塔维厄斯
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.24,0:37:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跑的时候他们可能掉出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.04,0:37:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰德
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.16,0:37:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克塔维厄斯
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.24,0:38:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰迪戴亚
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.28,0:38:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰德 奥克塔
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.08,0:38:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.88,0:38:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是奥克塔维厄斯的披风吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.56,0:38:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.76,0:38:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尼基搭把手 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.04,0:38:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.76,0:38:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁人
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.68,0:38:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰德
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.12,0:38:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳伦斯 在加热通风管里他们撑不久的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.40,0:38:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就他们那小身板
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.86,0:38:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定会被烤得像西奈的甲虫似的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.72,0:38:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的太黑暗了点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.32,0:39:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就到这了 兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.20,0:39:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最后的决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.40,0:39:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,牵住我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.32,0:39:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,为毛
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.84,0:39:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我没说
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.48,0:39:26.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（西翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.92,0:39:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,想回去恐怕不容易了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.36,0:39:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚是不是让我牵你手了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.84,0:39:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.96,0:39:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.92,0:39:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰德
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.40,0:39:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克塔
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.20,0:39:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能在从这儿到进气口的任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.00,0:40:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,小德 你看到什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.28,0:40:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳伦斯 他是只猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.68,0:40:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不能说话
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.00,0:40:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但他能钻进去
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.00,0:40:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼基 手机给我
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.04,0:40:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干嘛 - 给小德
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.36,0:40:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底怎么了我完全一头雾水
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.20,0:40:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是 老爸 怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.96,0:40:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像是追踪了你的手机
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.00,0:40:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像追踪了 你居然追踪我的手机
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.48,0:40:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我是你爹 我是为了保护你
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.20,0:40:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 你等等
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.40,0:40:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,监视某人和保护某人
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.56,0:40:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全是两码事
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.20,0:40:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,会还给你的 我保证
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.60,0:40:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在 要先放猴子背上
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.24,0:40:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 小德 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.64,0:40:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.00,0:40:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我要你下去找到他们 好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.96,0:40:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得能行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.84,0:40:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.04,0:40:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意安全
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.16,0:41:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该就是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.64,0:41:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.88,0:41:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,真经典
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.64,0:41:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞笑的天赋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.76,0:41:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你啊 小铃铛
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.28,0:41:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个使命吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.92,0:41:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.48,0:41:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不是要去埃及吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.20,0:41:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但得先救他们
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.16,0:41:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,使命可不能这样对待
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.60,0:41:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,使命只有一个 不能既是圣杯又是猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.16,0:41:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 可是我的人不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.28,0:41:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,而德克斯特能找到他们
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.64,0:41:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们的使命是什么 黄金
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.96,0:41:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不老泉
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.52,0:41:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔法金碑
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.60,0:42:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是阿卡拿的那东西
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.92,0:42:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,要从他那里抢过来也不是太难啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.96,0:42:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很瘦 线条是不错
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.00,0:42:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但很羸弱
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.64,0:42:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跟从埃及小宝宝手上抢糖一样容易
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.24,0:42:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有要抢 我们要修它
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.12,0:42:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,它出了点问题
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.88,0:42:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来话长
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.68,0:42:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你别再继续努力找小猩猩
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.34,0:42:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许情况也就不那么长了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.76,0:42:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不是猩猩 它是僧帽猴
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.48,0:42:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄臣似乎很焦虑
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.00,0:42:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他常常会那样
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.56,0:42:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我保证 他绝对不傻
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.64,0:42:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的是真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.04,0:42:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿的那块金碑有魔力
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.92,0:42:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实如此
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.52,0:42:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你周遭的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.80,0:42:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在今夜首次苏醒
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.36,0:42:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为这块金碑
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.52,0:42:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.16,0:42:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们不是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.52,0:42:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们与我们一样真实
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.64,0:42:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但我们是真人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.48,0:43:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是东西
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.36,0:43:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他们并未发觉
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.16,0:43:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一定十分愚蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.68,0:43:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,最初是会有点困惑
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.44,0:43:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好呀 青蛙
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.28,0:43:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续跳吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.60,0:43:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.00,0:43:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙们 我们要穿过亚洲馆
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.96,0:43:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他完全没发觉
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.12,0:43:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.48,0:43:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么也看不清
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.36,0:43:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以跳下去 祈求上天保佑
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.84,0:43:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不知道下面有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.28,0:43:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也不知道这里有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.48,0:44:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一座罗马古城
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.44,0:44:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里散发的历史感如此似曾相识
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.52,0:44:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,人都去哪里了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.12,0:44:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前见过这座城 我很肯定
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.56,0:44:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马人
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.76,0:44:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你手臂上写了一位女士的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.52,0:44:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德莉亚 对
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.56,0:44:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位安德莉亚女士便是你的格温娜维尔
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.84,0:44:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人阻止你们相爱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.76,0:44:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我爸那天有点把事情搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.56,0:44:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尼克 - 我们不走了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.36,0:44:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让任何人阻碍你的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.80,0:44:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,说是「命运」太夸张了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.80,0:44:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不过一起上微积分课
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.44,0:44:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实更像那种
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.88,0:44:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍纵即逝的眼神接触
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.52,0:44:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,「谁先转移视线」
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.76,0:44:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我听懂了 任何人也不能
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.04,0:44:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.40,0:45:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝庞
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.84,0:45:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝庞
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.08,0:45:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没见过啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.92,0:45:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个王八蛋是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.52,0:45:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 庞培 - 不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.80,0:45:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我听不太清你说什么 - 庞培
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.44,0:45:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们儿 我听不懂你的话
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.04,0:45:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有东西挡住你了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.96,0:45:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.04,0:45:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们慌张地逃去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.12,0:45:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为我们说的话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.04,0:45:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回贝庞来
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.64,0:45:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里好宽敞 快回来
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.20,0:45:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们跟蜥蜴一样疯狂
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.00,0:45:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.44,0:45:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 朋友 我们只是路过
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.28,0:45:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是西藏的金翅鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.45,0:45:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,金翅鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.52,0:45:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 金翅鸟 你好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.44,0:45:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,金翅鸟 你好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.76,0:45:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.96,0:46:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们只是
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.60,0:46:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须要过去 没时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.12,0:46:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.64,0:46:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会跟你玩这个游戏的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.96,0:46:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的要过去
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.68,0:46:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.96,0:46:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 龙 - 不 不是龙 这是
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.05,0:46:33.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（相柳 象征灾难之蛇妖）
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.88,0:46:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是相柳
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.96,0:46:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说中的蛇妖
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.04,0:46:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着还是像龙 我说杀了它
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.16,0:46:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不 它在睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.16,0:46:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.50,0:46:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁它睡觉时偷袭不够刺激
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.40,0:46:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们叫醒它然后再杀了它
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.92,0:46:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先上 孩子跟我走
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.80,0:46:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不 孩子不能跟你走
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.84,0:46:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么 - 因为他还是个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.00,0:46:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉里 每个人生命中
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.64,0:46:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,都必须经历屠龙的那刻
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.24,0:46:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个孩子不行
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.44,0:46:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还没写完
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.22,0:46:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,犹太成人礼里的感谢卡
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.76,0:47:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是个比喻
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.72,0:47:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的故乡不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.84,0:47:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在不会去屠龙
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.84,0:47:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们绕过它
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.28,0:47:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就绕 不然要失去信号了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.28,0:47:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.96,0:47:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝庞
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.28,0:47:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞培
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.72,0:47:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝庞 你确定念的是对的吗 朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.12,0:47:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞培
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.45,0:47:37.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（庞培）
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.80,0:47:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,「庞培」
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.12,0:48:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,「不要问你的国家能为你做什么」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.48,0:48:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,「问问你能为你的国家做什么」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.64,0:48:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.00,0:48:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,匈奴王 嘘
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.44,0:48:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 泰迪 - 冲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.52,0:48:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.60,0:48:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,它醒了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.72,0:48:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们可以杀它了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.88,0:48:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.36,0:48:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼基
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.24,0:48:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去救那个男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.52,0:48:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 以前玩过剑吗 - 在魔兽世界里玩过
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.72,0:48:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看着学吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.72,0:49:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我们唯一的恐惧就是恐惧本身」
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.00,0:49:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,「布朗 干得不错」
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.60,0:49:25.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（点击器）
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.16,0:49:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你后面
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.40,0:49:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.68,0:49:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后的战役 好基友
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.64,0:50:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候乱涂烧烤酱了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.20,0:50:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.48,0:50:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 你不能这样
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.08,0:50:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他别无选择
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.52,0:50:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.44,0:51:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对今天发生的一切绝口不提
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.40,0:51:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 有这必要吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.16,0:51:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,火都灭了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.32,0:51:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来这些东西确实能救命
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.52,0:51:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.08,0:51:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.00,0:51:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 - 没事 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.32,0:51:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才很勇敢 阁下
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.20,0:51:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证 总有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.52,0:51:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会在胜利的酒杯中饮龙血
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.68,0:51:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喝苏打水或水就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.76,0:51:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我很喜欢刚才的活动
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.88,0:51:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在起 你必须选择自己的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.88,0:51:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要被别人左右
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.20,0:51:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该让拉里知道我们没事
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.72,0:51:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,转身
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.36,0:51:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉里肯定在担心我们
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.00,0:52:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们要怎么找他们
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.40,0:52:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳伦斯
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.12,0:52:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况恐怕恶化了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.08,0:52:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 我正在慢慢变回蜡像
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.88,0:52:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 等一下再找他们
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.36,0:52:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得马上去埃及
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.64,0:52:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 不找杰德和奥克塔维厄斯了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.44,0:52:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.76,0:52:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的骑士绝不逃避责任
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.12,0:52:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果再不去埃及 我们谁也救不了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.20,0:52:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸比说 「留下」
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.32,0:52:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.00,0:52:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸比说拉不吃
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.12,0:53:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下 拉
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.84,0:53:16.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（埃及馆 法老王年代）
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.24,0:53:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.32,0:53:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我应该陪你进去
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.28,0:53:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我想我们应该就此分别
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.36,0:53:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 是 我们搞得定
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.56,0:53:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.96,0:53:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友们
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.16,0:53:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉里
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.24,0:53:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔法金碑的小丑脸守护者
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.60,0:53:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不会忘记你的勇敢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.36,0:53:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及你的滑稽
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.52,0:53:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.88,0:53:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不应该说再见
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.68,0:53:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在说再见 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.80,0:53:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要说再见 我要走了 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.36,0:53:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.56,0:53:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.28,0:53:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.52,0:53:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已有许多夜没见过这些墙壁了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.28,0:54:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿卡曼
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.68,0:54:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.28,0:54:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.28,0:54:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回家 儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.36,0:54:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想给你介绍一下我的朋友们
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.84,0:54:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是门罗卡拉
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.84,0:54:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼罗河的法老 太阳之子的父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.92,0:54:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是茜茜赫特
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.32,0:54:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,九国熠熠发光的珠宝
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.44,0:54:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是拉里
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.96,0:54:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁克林守护者
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.44,0:54:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.64,0:54:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在实际上住在曼哈顿
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.44,0:54:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但它听起来没那么酷
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.72,0:54:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果您能检查一下金碑
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.08,0:54:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会感到很荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.64,0:54:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有些不对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.80,0:54:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不懂为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.24,0:54:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在和法老说话
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.88,0:54:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲吻我的权杖
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.16,0:55:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不亲可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.44,0:55:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须表现尊敬
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.28,0:55:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我乃太阳神之后代
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.72,0:55:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常理解 也非常尊敬您
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.96,0:55:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不信仰太阳神 因此
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.40,0:55:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃及神是唯一的真神
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.16,0:55:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不想太狭隘
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.08,0:55:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如萨卡加维亚 她信奉祖先的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.96,0:55:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你崇拜的是山羊神吧 匈奴王
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.64,0:55:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是半爱尔兰裔半犹太裔
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.48,0:55:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 我爱犹太人
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.68,0:55:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拥有4万多个犹太人
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.52,0:55:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们太可爱了 - 又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.88,0:55:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很开心 总拿着蜡烛歌唱
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.60,0:55:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实他们真的不开心
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.96,0:55:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 是的 他们离开了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.00,0:55:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了逃亡他们在沙漠中度过了四十年
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.88,0:55:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们每年一次的晚餐上都会说这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.76,0:55:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对我们来说很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.56,0:55:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,您能看看金碑吗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.92,0:55:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,它出了点问题
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.68,0:56:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的力量在流失
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.20,0:56:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,您能修好它吗
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.72,0:56:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样的话我就必须说出金碑的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.64,0:56:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证不告诉别人
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.72,0:56:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.44,0:56:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会亲吻您的权杖
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.80,0:56:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.44,0:56:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲 为什么你就是不肯说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.96,0:56:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,秘密必须在合适的时候才能传给你
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.52,0:56:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经都四千年了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.52,0:56:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不如就现在吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.80,0:56:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在午夜降生的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.36,0:56:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那时是法老
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.80,0:56:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我阅过无数人类梦寐以求的瑰宝
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.52,0:56:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当我第一次见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.36,0:56:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我便知道对我来说你比任何
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.20,0:56:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,古代世界的瑰宝更珍贵
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.28,0:56:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我无法忍受与你分别
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.52,0:56:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我命令大祭司为你打造一份礼物 儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.16,0:57:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,用尽我们对死后世界的一切知识
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.24,0:57:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,在孔苏 月神也是夜行人守护神的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.04,0:57:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,神殿里 我们锻造了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.88,0:57:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿卡曼拉金碑
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.60,0:57:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,陵墓的设计
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.00,0:57:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,使月神之光照耀金碑
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.68,0:57:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜夜复原其力量
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.60,0:57:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,月亮神将其力量赠予金碑
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.48,0:57:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要其沐浴在月光下
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.44,0:57:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一家即可永远在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.76,0:57:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡也无法将我们分离
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.56,0:57:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今它已远离月神之光太久
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.20,0:57:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.64,0:57:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.56,0:57:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,它需要月光
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.88,0:57:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则天亮时我们都会死去
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.44,0:57:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.28,0:57:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果金碑逝去
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.80,0:58:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任何事物能重赋它力量
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.44,0:58:06.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（埃及艳后）
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.20,0:58:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.40,0:58:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,金碑给我 快
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.64,0:58:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 听我说 那东西快死了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.96,0:58:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它不吸取月光
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.68,0:58:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都将结束 永远的结束
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.64,0:58:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚瑟王浪费许多年月寻找圣杯
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.00,0:58:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来它一直是块金碑
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.80,0:58:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它给我 你根本不知道自己在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.76,0:58:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的使命完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.48,0:58:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,今夜我将奔赴卡米洛特
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.92,0:58:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就留着 行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.40,0:58:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要把它放在月光底下
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.64,0:58:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要把中间那块转过来
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.12,0:58:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 那不是我的首要使命
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.04,0:58:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 埃里克比你搞笑多了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.28,0:58:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫上大伙
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.24,0:58:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让他离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.48,0:59:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,镇定 伙计 给我慢点
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.04,0:59:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.56,0:59:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我相当确定那个金碑不属于你
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.28,0:59:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.80,0:59:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我回来 这事没完
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.16,0:59:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会为今天用巨剑和醉人的蓝眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.08,0:59:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘲笑我们的行为后悔的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.48,0:59:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他眼睛是很蓝啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.00,0:59:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,（艾舍尔作品）\N温言在口 大棒在手
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.20,0:59:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳伦斯 我们有麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.04,0:59:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只手也变回蜡像了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.12,0:59:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有句名言
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.48,0:59:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,「恶言在口 只需更粗的大棒在手」
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.32,1:00:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在那边 - 是在上面
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.24,1:00:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.24,1:00:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.32,1:00:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 泰迪 - 金碑 给我
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.04,1:00:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再问第二遍 你个弄臣
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.28,1:00:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,绕得我头都晕了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.84,1:00:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,金碑给我
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.72,1:00:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手吧 劳伦斯
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.04,1:00:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 泰迪 不要
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.68,1:00:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.56,1:00:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不就得了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.24,1:01:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,归我了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.84,1:01:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚那招不错
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.20,1:01:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到能成功
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.60,1:01:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉里
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.80,1:01:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 你们没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.84,1:01:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,胳膊腿还在
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.08,1:01:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克塔维厄斯 我想这是你的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.64,1:01:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.32,1:01:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.56,1:01:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么兰斯洛特还能跑能跳我们却逐渐衰弱
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.84,1:01:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他苏醒的第一晚
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.04,1:01:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,新生儿更强壮 但也没有用
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.72,1:01:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非我们成功 不然太阳出来他也会死
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.60,1:01:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让他离开博物馆
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.80,1:01:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 请你回埃及以防他从那里跑了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.76,1:01:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 尼基和匈奴王看着装货口
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.68,1:01:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 收到 - 泰迪去南翼 看好侧门
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.84,1:01:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我负责主入口
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.44,1:02:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 我就知道你有点不对劲
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.44,1:02:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到刚过去的了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.60,1:02:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到什么
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.92,1:02:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个中世纪骑士骑着马过去了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.56,1:02:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别用你的幻想害我分心
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.96,1:02:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在货仓找到你这个脏兮兮的孪生兄弟了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.52,1:02:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是我兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.04,1:02:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓到他了 他有什么好给自己辩解的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.56,1:02:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 你丫闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.16,1:02:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴 你想被锤吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.16,1:02:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跑啊 但你要是跑出围栏
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.80,1:02:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 你这个丑了吧唧的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.08,1:02:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着像「数乌鸦合唱团」主唱的二重身
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.68,1:02:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会挨我一锤
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.40,1:02:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸比
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.64,1:02:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.80,1:02:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他小命就在我锤下
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.40,1:02:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸比
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.48,1:02:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.88,1:02:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.96,1:02:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到我做蠢事的时候别学我 好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.20,1:02:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我也一直在跟尼克这么说
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.52,1:02:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他就是不明白 懂吗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.32,1:03:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很聪明
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.88,1:03:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想给他我不曾有过的机会
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.36,1:03:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,先上好学 再去休假
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.44,1:03:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,先上好学 再去休假
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.44,1:03:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉 拉 住手
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.52,1:03:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.72,1:03:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.08,1:03:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你们干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.16,1:03:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.00,1:03:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫尼克 这是德克斯特 匈奴王汗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.48,1:03:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你们真高兴
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.08,1:03:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在见识见识锤子
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.36,1:04:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.84,1:04:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我知道信息量很大
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.40,1:04:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是匈奴王又是猴子
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.00,1:04:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么鬼 好奇怪 需要消化
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.92,1:04:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧 对不起了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.52,1:04:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 - 你跑不掉的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.44,1:04:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在大脑已经在画你们的肖像了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.60,1:04:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,雀斑男
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.40,1:04:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有接发的胖亚洲人 坏猴子
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.36,1:04:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想应该是家教问题吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.52,1:04:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他出身离异家庭
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.08,1:04:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他心里对我应该也是五味杂陈
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.96,1:04:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能有点恋母情结
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.80,1:04:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.96,1:04:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确实没有经常陪他
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.28,1:04:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我应该是映射了我自己的愧疚
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.56,1:04:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后在不知不觉中
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.28,1:04:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,反映到了对待他的方式上
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.96,1:04:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.56,1:04:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,门
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.28,1:04:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,头
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.16,1:04:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.32,1:04:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,开
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.28,1:05:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,头
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.72,1:05:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开思路
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.48,1:05:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没错 你说得对
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.24,1:05:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但问题又来了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.48,1:05:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都有前后联系 我也知道
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.00,1:05:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我教育他的方式
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.24,1:05:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是仿照我父母对我的教育方式
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.84,1:05:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是事实上 他是一个独立个案
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.16,1:05:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们是有部分相同的基因
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.48,1:05:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但说实话 他比我成熟得多了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.16,1:05:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让我的自负心和童年阴影
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.00,1:05:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止他吃一堑长一智
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.16,1:05:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后成长为他理应成为的大人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.48,1:05:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是用头撞开门
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.00,1:05:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.12,1:05:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的 拉 走了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.08,1:05:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大家都没事吧 - 是的 劳伦斯
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.68,1:05:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,匈奴王和你儿子把女保安关在门房里了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.04,1:05:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不太清楚能关她多久
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.76,1:05:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找到兰斯洛特
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.00,1:05:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但得有人确保她不会逃出来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.96,1:05:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 拉 好的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.00,1:05:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道该怎么做吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.96,1:05:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.12,1:05:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 确保她一直待在里面
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.04,1:05:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 留下 - 好样的 去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.04,1:05:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸比说「留下」
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.88,1:05:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳伦斯
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.04,1:06:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我胳膊动不了了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.36,1:06:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们越来越虚弱了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.28,1:06:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 大块头
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.56,1:06:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.96,1:06:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你眼睛好像有点不对劲
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.04,1:06:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 就是有点那什么
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.96,1:06:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得放松 好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.40,1:06:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静下来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.72,1:06:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,匈奴王 匈奴王
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.68,1:06:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,匈奴王不会吓得喘不过气
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.04,1:06:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你强取
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.88,1:06:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你豪夺
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.84,1:06:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会崩溃
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.40,1:06:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.00,1:06:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 城里面有八百万人
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.68,1:06:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在真的在哪都有可能
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.72,1:06:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到他的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.08,1:06:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须得找到
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.00,1:06:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,吾爱 我来了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.60,1:07:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.28,1:07:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从这边走
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.44,1:07:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,四里格每小时的速度
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.92,1:07:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.08,1:07:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,遇到狮子不能跑 劳伦斯
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.60,1:07:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁人 快把手电筒拿出来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.60,1:07:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些猫咪想玩
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.12,1:07:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的 他拿到了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.04,1:07:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 先生
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.88,1:07:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑呀
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.64,1:07:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰斯洛特到底在哪
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.44,1:07:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.16,1:08:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好放我出来 你这恶心的猿人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.76,1:08:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看什么看 别看了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.32,1:08:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没见过我这么漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.96,1:08:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,迷人 魅力四射
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.64,1:08:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是不爱吃匹萨都能去当模特的美女啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.68,1:08:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.44,1:08:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你 没用的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.80,1:08:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没用的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.32,1:08:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好像有点用
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.52,1:08:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对卡米洛特都干了些什么
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.56,1:08:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,简而言之 没有什么地方
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.72,1:08:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,能比卡米洛特
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.68,1:08:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,更适合永远
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.56,1:08:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸福快乐地
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.32,1:09:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活下去
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.40,1:09:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,久违了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.04,1:09:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格温娜维尔 吾爱 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.48,1:09:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么能帮你的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.08,1:09:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.64,1:09:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是兰斯洛特爵士啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.88,1:09:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完成我的使命了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.72,1:09:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.36,1:09:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是真的格温娜维尔
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.56,1:09:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是爱丽丝·伊芙 你可能搞混了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.00,1:09:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能看过我的演出
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.80,1:09:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的声音如此悦耳动听
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.00,1:09:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我完全不知道你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.92,1:09:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 听着
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.48,1:09:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 伙计
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.04,1:09:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,缓过神来 老兄
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.76,1:09:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是说 她是扮演格温娜维尔的演员
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.84,1:09:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 我也是演员
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.84,1:09:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么演员
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.08,1:09:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.24,1:09:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.60,1:09:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,王冠摘下来
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.76,1:09:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 休·杰克曼
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.08,1:09:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴上王冠认不出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.44,1:09:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧 这一套看着不太像
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.92,1:09:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,大演员
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.84,1:09:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么破名字
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.44,1:09:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着就像扯淡
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.76,1:09:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有懦夫才会用假名 亚瑟
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.28,1:09:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是休·杰克曼
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.76,1:09:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,而另一方面
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.04,1:09:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带来了你寻求已久
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.76,1:09:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,却无处可觅的宝藏
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.56,1:10:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊 永生之门的钥匙
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.96,1:10:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挺喜欢你的戏服
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.56,1:10:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,也喜欢这份对演艺事业的热情
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.76,1:10:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你真心得下台了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.64,1:10:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰斯洛特爵士 女士们先生们
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.96,1:10:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.16,1:10:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不错
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.36,1:10:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,真丢人 亚瑟
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.48,1:10:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你配不上你的王冠
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.12,1:10:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,也配不上你的王后
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.08,1:10:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好吃我一剑
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.92,1:10:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,大演员
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.12,1:10:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 这都是演戏
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.80,1:10:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧见没
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.08,1:10:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一看就不是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.72,1:10:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这全都不是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.60,1:10:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.92,1:10:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,演出不错
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.12,1:10:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们都身临其境了 - 的确是
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.96,1:10:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这都不是真的真的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.28,1:10:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.40,1:10:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.84,1:10:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我对卡米洛特朝思暮想多久了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.84,1:11:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.96,1:11:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都不是
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.40,1:11:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.28,1:11:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都不是
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.84,1:11:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 别 都请坐下
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.76,1:11:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.68,1:11:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们和你一样都是上帝造的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.52,1:11:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如你拍张照片吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.16,1:11:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,照片恒久远啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.44,1:11:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想和气点 但你够了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.68,1:11:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上从台上下去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.64,1:11:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 你吓不到我
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.60,1:11:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,大演员
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.72,1:11:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 伙计 你不会想跟我单挑
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.56,1:11:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,真打起来 我打你跟玩一样
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.48,1:11:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.40,1:11:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.84,1:11:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.00,1:11:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在出金刚狼的大招
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.44,1:11:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.52,1:11:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.00,1:11:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,得有爪子秀胸肌才有效果
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.88,1:11:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得也是
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.20,1:12:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰斯洛特
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.56,1:12:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰斯洛特
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.36,1:12:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.76,1:12:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 那不是出口
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.48,1:12:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 上来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.08,1:12:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 都上来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.68,1:12:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有猴子 好极了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.88,1:12:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,戏服不错
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.24,1:12:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 但我得说 你是绝对的主角
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.52,1:12:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 老兄
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.60,1:12:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他认出你了 - 是啊 真好
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.68,1:12:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把金碑给我
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.40,1:12:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 退后
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.60,1:12:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过来
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.00,1:12:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.84,1:12:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.40,1:12:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.76,1:12:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的鼻子
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.92,1:12:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我鼻子怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.44,1:12:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的鼻子要掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.88,1:12:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 它化了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.08,1:12:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为火把
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.28,1:12:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.88,1:12:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多糟
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.04,1:12:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太好
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.60,1:12:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我是兰斯洛特
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.96,1:12:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本就没有什么兰斯洛特
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.12,1:12:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰斯洛特只是个传说
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.40,1:12:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是真实存在的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.12,1:13:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.28,1:13:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你一时半会很难接受
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.26,1:13:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,请把金碑给我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.64,1:13:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢 回到博物馆吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.96,1:13:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,站在那里 让小孩子指指点点吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.40,1:13:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还可以学习
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.80,1:13:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他们启发 让他们去做伟大的事
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.24,1:13:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,很少有人能有这么高尚的使命 朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.32,1:13:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说不一样
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.96,1:13:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有卡米洛特
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.92,1:13:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有格温娜维尔和兰斯洛特
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.48,1:13:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就只是一尊畸形的蜡像
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.80,1:13:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再看我的鼻子了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.40,1:13:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没在看 - 你有 我看到了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.16,1:13:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很鄙视地盯着我的鼻子看
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.00,1:13:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没有 - 你有
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.24,1:13:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别看它
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.32,1:13:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不看真的很难
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.44,1:13:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.16,1:13:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没有 - 你有
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.32,1:13:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是看着你的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.48,1:13:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,猴子 别看了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.08,1:13:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,把金碑给我吧 求你了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.96,1:13:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你把金碑给我 我保证我不再
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.24,1:13:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别盯着我的鼻子看
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.48,1:13:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把金碑给我 - 别看
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.86,1:13:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把金碑给我 - 不看我的鼻子
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.66,1:13:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有那么难吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.68,1:13:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不看你的鼻子
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.28,1:13:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我忍不住啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.52,1:13:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看天空
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.36,1:13:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太恶心了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.84,1:13:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他还是那么帅
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.52,1:14:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这一刻开始
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.02,1:14:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都不准看或提到我的鼻子
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.76,1:14:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我忘记我们说到哪里了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.20,1:14:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳伦斯
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.04,1:14:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.64,1:14:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉里
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.88,1:14:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们时间不多了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.20,1:14:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 你必须把碎片摆正
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.72,1:14:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不把碎片摆正 他们都要死
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.88,1:14:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也一样
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.96,1:14:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有卡米洛特的世界 活着也毫无意义
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.20,1:14:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.16,1:14:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,德克斯特 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.68,1:14:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.72,1:14:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.72,1:14:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.04,1:14:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想扇我吗 来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.92,1:14:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 扇我的脸啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.88,1:15:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,小德
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.88,1:15:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,德克斯特
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.32,1:15:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,德克斯特
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.96,1:15:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.92,1:15:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,德克斯特 快醒来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.44,1:15:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 它死了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.68,1:15:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我想牵你的手了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.88,1:15:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我终于明白了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.04,1:15:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直以来使命的意义都是猴子
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.12,1:15:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是金碑
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.12,1:15:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都是为了他们
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.20,1:15:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,请原谅我
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.60,1:15:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来我才是那个傻子
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.32,1:16:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们复活了 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.68,1:16:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳伦斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.92,1:16:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.32,1:16:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 拉里
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.60,1:16:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒 这才是我们的人嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.44,1:16:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,来
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.36,1:16:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的金碑
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.00,1:16:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这感觉真好 杰迪戴亚
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.32,1:16:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那当然
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.20,1:16:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.64,1:17:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看起来怎样
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.04,1:17:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来像兰斯洛特
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.20,1:17:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.88,1:17:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.68,1:17:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我儿子安全送回来
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.68,1:17:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着自己的孩子长大成人
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.20,1:17:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一件很奇妙的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.48,1:17:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时有很多狮子在追我们
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.48,1:17:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很神奇
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.72,1:17:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,前一天才骑着恐龙穿行中央公园
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.40,1:17:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二天就在伊比沙打碟了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.24,1:17:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竭力为我们家族效劳
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.72,1:17:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会为你建一个堆满金银财宝的墓
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.04,1:18:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会确保 你的器官
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.56,1:18:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,被分装在塞满珠宝的罐子里
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.08,1:18:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.60,1:18:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么定了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.28,1:18:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳伦斯
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.60,1:18:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,能跟你聊聊吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.24,1:18:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和其他人商量了一下
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.60,1:18:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿卡曼拉属于他的家人
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.60,1:18:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他必须留在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.08,1:18:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,金碑也理应留在这里 孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.56,1:18:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是它的归属地 铁人
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.88,1:18:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.92,1:18:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就意味着你们也要留下了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.36,1:18:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们属于纽约
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.24,1:18:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.72,1:18:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们走了 你们会
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.44,1:18:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们今晚之后就不会复活了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.60,1:18:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是博物馆的展品 小拉里
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.56,1:18:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本来就不会动
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.56,1:18:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙儿来看我们
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.44,1:18:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许能学到点东西
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.88,1:18:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是活着了 兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.80,1:18:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.48,1:19:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本该照顾好你们的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.24,1:19:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做到了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.48,1:19:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 劳伦斯
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.84,1:19:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们准备好了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.96,1:19:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我没有
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.76,1:19:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.16,1:19:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你让我回到家人的身边 拉里
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.96,1:19:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,布克林的守卫者
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.16,1:19:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 如果我们现在出发
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.36,1:19:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能赶上飞机
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.52,1:19:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁着大家还清醒
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.76,1:19:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在太阳出来前回到家
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.16,1:19:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.04,1:19:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回家吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.88,1:19:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张 拉里
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.20,1:19:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经达成共识了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.20,1:19:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 特利克西 坐下
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.88,1:19:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错哦
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.48,1:19:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 兰斯
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.00,1:19:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.40,1:20:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,特利克西 听话
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.00,1:20:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.72,1:20:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.04,1:20:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他根本就不听我说话
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.48,1:20:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.92,1:20:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉你真的有听我说话
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.28,1:20:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的心脏
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.78,1:20:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像在同步跳动一样
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.20,1:20:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉到
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.56,1:20:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 打扰了 你们的事
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.80,1:20:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉 大伙在外面等着呢 我们得走了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.92,1:20:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.60,1:20:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉 留下
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.16,1:20:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这听起来很荒唐
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.08,1:20:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们俩可以在英国好好过日子
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.97,1:20:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.92,1:20:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.20,1:21:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远也不会忘记你的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.84,1:21:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我遇到过最粗犷的男人
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.12,1:21:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,发带就留给你吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.84,1:21:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉 我们得走了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.84,1:21:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.48,1:21:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不说我也不会说的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.64,1:21:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你很讨厌这份工作和这一切
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.83,1:21:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但明晚之后
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.80,1:21:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,将是最棒的工作
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.36,1:21:53.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（自然历史博物馆）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.24,1:22:10.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（指令1 丢骨头）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.68,1:22:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的好安静
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.04,1:22:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了金碑 这里就是个普通博物馆
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.40,1:22:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我最想念你们什么吗
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.96,1:22:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.92,1:22:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的小身板儿
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.24,1:22:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,来抱抱
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.88,1:22:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,来抱抱
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.72,1:22:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱一下
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.72,1:22:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.76,1:22:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.88,1:23:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会说英语啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.92,1:23:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.32,1:23:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在楼顶上的时候 当
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.16,1:23:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你快
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.40,1:23:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.12,1:23:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想你知道
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.36,1:23:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我改变了我对事物的看法
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.64,1:23:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我们的关系很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.92,1:23:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们时而亲近 时而疏远
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.60,1:23:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,反复不断
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.52,1:23:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我指的是 游戏 你懂吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.84,1:23:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们制定了规矩
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.44,1:23:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们为什么要这样做呢
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.12,1:23:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉 我们之间
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.76,1:23:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,达成了一种互相尊重的共识
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.36,1:23:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.12,1:24:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想你的 你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.56,1:24:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 没事
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.80,1:24:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 最后一巴掌
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.56,1:24:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也觉得我们早该亲了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.92,1:24:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.76,1:25:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能想到呢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.68,1:25:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是蜡 她是聚氨酯
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.92,1:25:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们却相爱了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.88,1:25:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,到此为止了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.68,1:25:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.04,1:25:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻的尼克一定会成就一番大事
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.56,1:25:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.44,1:25:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备自己去迎接世界的洗礼
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.28,1:25:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也完成了你的使命
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.04,1:25:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完成了你的使命
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.36,1:25:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候开启下一段旅程了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.36,1:25:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全不知道自己明天要干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.88,1:25:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那多激动人心啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.56,1:25:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 泰迪
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.44,1:25:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 劳伦斯
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.60,1:26:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓坏了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.84,1:26:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑一笑 孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.28,1:26:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.28,1:26:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.48,1:26:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很好 - 那就好
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.52,1:26:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,还去伊比沙吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.76,1:26:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于当DJ的事 爸
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.36,1:26:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道它是否适合我
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.60,1:26:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道它是我接下来要做的事
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.80,1:26:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这之后 也许就上大学
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.72,1:26:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也还在思考未来中
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.80,1:26:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来不错
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.88,1:27:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该回妈妈那了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.64,1:27:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.52,1:27:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.32,1:27:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.40,1:27:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱一个
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.16,1:27:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会放你走的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.64,1:27:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,回见
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.07,1:27:54.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（三年后）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.20,1:27:58.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（大英博物馆实物限时特展）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.04,1:28:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,三年了 都没见过拉里·戴利
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.68,1:28:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他牺牲自己 保住了我的工作
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.36,1:28:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说他去读书了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.20,1:28:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到了学位 当了一名教师
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.36,1:28:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很为他高兴
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.52,1:28:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他听到这次外展之后
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.64,1:28:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉里让我亲自己将这个给你
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.88,1:28:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这块臭名昭著 据说会发光的魔力金碑
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.12,1:28:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉里·戴利和他的童话故事
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.56,1:28:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉里说 我可以信任你
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.04,1:28:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.80,1:28:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,信任你能保守一个高级机密
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.72,1:28:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.16,1:28:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在使眼色 - 你那是眨眼
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.12,1:28:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是两只眼睛同时使眼色
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.12,1:28:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是眨眼
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.28,1:28:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是重点 重点是
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.48,1:28:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好给我做好准备了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.08,1:28:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备什么
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.40,1:28:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.16,1:29:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的发光了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.28,1:29:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.24,1:29:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.56,1:30:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.24,1:30:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好玩玩 笨笨
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.96,1:30:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.20,1:30:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哪也不去
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.08,1:30:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.44,1:30:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哪也不去
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.36,1:31:16.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（大英博物馆实物限时特展）
